<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Luguru Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Imbuli inoghile ka pfayandikighwe na Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Imbuli Inoghile iyandikighwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt1">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbuli inoghile iyandikighwe na Yohana yachitabu chimwe mna ipfitabu pfine ipfili mna Lilaghano lya Sambi ipfilangusa tsimbuli tsa Yesu Kiristu. Chila chimwe chokemighwa “Injili” (mana yake Mbuli inoghile). Ipfitabu apfino pfandikighwa na Matei, Maliki, Luka, na Yohana. Imbuli Inoghile aino yandikighwa na Yohana mna ghumwaka ka ghwa tisini apfino kulawa Yesu hayelekighwe. Hata kama ichitabu achino ng'achilonga baye ka Yohana yuyo iyachandike, lekeni pfachandikighwe cheghala na Ibaluwa ya mwanduso ya Yohana, na ya keli, na ya kadatu. Iwanu wa ghumwande iwang'ali wakwandika wolonga Yohana tsakakala kamna ghumji ghwa Efeso, apfo yakoneka ichitabu achino chandikighwa mna ghumji ghwa Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana kolonga mwatsimwatsi ka ichinu chikulu ichili mna ichitabu achino ambe ukuwapfila iwanu watoghole ka Yesu yuyo Kiristu, Mwana wa Imlungu yana ugima (20:31). Kwa ukutoghola apfo twakuwa na ugima mna litaghwa lyake. Ichitabu achino tsachandikighwa kwa pfilongotsi wa Wayahudi na wa iwanu iwali si Wayahudi baye. Imbuli Inoghile ya Yohana ng'aighala baye na Imbuli Inoghile ya Matei, Luka, na Maliki. Yohana kakomangitsa ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfayatendile Yesu, na ng'andike baye mbuli tsa mifano iyalapfile Yesu. Pfinu pfimwenga ka ukubatitsighwa kwa Yesu, na ukughetsighwa kwake kunyika, ng'apfandikighwe baye mna Injili aino.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mghati</para>
  <para style="io">Mna isula ya 1:1-18, Yohana kakwandusa Imbuli Inoghile</para>
  <para style="io">Mna isula ya 1:19-12-50, kakwandika ipfinu pfa ukukangawatsa pfayatendile Yesu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mna isula ya 13:1-20-31, kolonga mengi ighalawile mna ugima wa Yesu na ukufa kwake na ukutsihiluka kwake.</para>
  <para style="io">Mna isula ya 21, Yohana komalitsila kwa ukulonga Yesu pfayawalawile iwanu ahala hayatsihiluke na ichinu ichimtendile yeye yandike ichitabu achino.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Longa lya Ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Aho mwanduso ng'ana pfinu pfose pfiumbighwe yumwe yakemighwe Longa tsakabaho. Ayo Longa tsakakala na Imlungu, naye Longa kakala Mlungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Yeye tsakahamwe na Imlungu aho mwanduso. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Kubitila yeye pfinu pfose pfiumbighwa, na bila yeye kuduhu cho chose ichiumbighwe, mna apfila ipfiumbighwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Mghati mwake mumo mwaukalile ugima, na ugima awo tsauwa mwanga kwa iwanu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ghumwanga gholangatsa mchisi, na ichisi ng'achidaha kughutsima baye.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Tsakulawila munu yumwe iyatumighwe kulawa kwa Imlungu, taghwa lyake Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Ayo katsa kwa ukalangama, kuwalongela iwanu tsimbuli tsa ghumwanga, ili kubitila yeye iwanu wose wahulike na watoghole. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yeye imwenyegho ng'akalile ghumwanga baye, ila katsa yawalongele iwanu tsimbuli tsa ghumwanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Aghuno ghugho ghumwanga ghwa kweli, ghumwanga ighung'ali ghukutsa muisi kuwalangatsa iwanu wose.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Ayo Longa kakala muisi, na hata kama Imlungu tsakaumba isi yose kubitila yeye, iwanu ng'awamtangile baye. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Katsa ukaye yake, lekeni iwanu wake ng'awambokele baye. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Lekeni iwanu wose iwambokele, awala iwamtoghole, kawatenda wadahe kuwa wana wa Imlungu; <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />iwana ing'awelekighwe baye kwa uwetso wa iwanu, wala kwa ngupfu tsa ilukuli, au ka pfayobama imunu, ila ka pfayobama Imlungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Naye Longa katendeka kuwa lukuli, kakala hamwe na twetwe. Na twetwe tuwona utunitso wake, utunitso ka wa Imwana nyalimwe, iyatsile kulawa kwa Baba, kamema uluso na ukweli.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohana kalonga tsimbuli tsake. Kakemelela kulonga, “Ayuno yuyo yaniwalongele apfino, ‘Ayo iyakutsa kuchughu kwangu mkulu kubita nene kwaapfila yeye tsakabaho ng'ana nene nyelekighwe.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kwa apfila mna ukutimilika kwake, twetwe twose tubokela ketseketse, uluso mchanya mwa uluso. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Mana Imulungu tsakalapfa Itorati kubitila Musa, lekeni uluso na ukweli pfitsa kubitila Yesu Kiristu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Tsa kuduhu munu wowose ma iyamwonile Imulungu, ila Imlungu Mwana yaliyeka, iyali habehi ghendo na Baba, yuyo iyomtenda Imulungu yamanyike.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Yohana Imbatitsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Malk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Auno wuwo ukalangama wa Yohana, iwakulu wa Wayahudi wa Yerusalemu hawawatumile iwatambika na Walawi waghende kwa Yohana kumghutsa yeye tsayakalile nani.<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohana ng'alemile baye ukuwedika, lekeni kawalongela mwatsimwatsi ghendo, “Nene sili Kiristu baye.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Wamghutsa, “Lelo ghweghwe uli nani? Pfihi ghweghwe kwa Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Naye kawedika, “Baye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Wamghutsa keli, “Au ghweghwe kwa inabii ayula iyalongighwe katsakutsa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Kawedika, “Baye.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Kuya wamghutsa, “Lelo ghweghwe uli nani? Tulongele, ili na twetwe tukawalongele iwatutumile tukughutse. Ghweghwe ghumwenyegho ulongatse?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohana kawedika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">“Nene na litsi lya imunu iyokema kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">Muigholose inzila ya Imtwatsa! Ka pfayalongile nabii Isaya,”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Na iwasenga awala iwatumighwe tsawalawa kwa Mafarisayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />nawo wamghutsa, walonga, “Lelo hebari ubatitsa, ka ghweghwe ng'uli Kiristu baye, wala Eliya, wala inabii ayula?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohana kawedika, “Nene nobatitsa kwa ghamatsi, lekeni mghati mwenu kuna yumwe yang'amummanyile mwemwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Ayo yuyo iyakutsa kuchughu kwangu, na kwa ukulu wake nene sibamighwa baye hata ukudohola imitsabi ya imikwabatsa yake.” <figure style="fig" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" ref="1:27">5. Imunu kakoa imitsabi ye imikwabatsa</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Agha ghose ghalawila Betaniya, kumwambu kwa ghumto Yoridani, Yohana kwayang'ali yobatitsa.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Imwanang'olo wa Imlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Litsuwa lya keli Yohana kamwona Yesu komtsila, kalonga, “Mlole! Imwanang'olo wa Imulungu iyosola tsinzambi tsa isi yose! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ayuno yuyo yanilongile mbuli tsake, haniwalongele, ‘Kakutsa munu kuchughu kwangu iyali mkulu kubita nene, kwaapfila tsakabaho nene ng'ana nyelekighwe.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Nene nimwenyegho tsasimmanyile baye, ila nitsa kubatitsa kwa ghamatsi ili yeye yamanyike kwa iwanu wa Isiraeli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Kuya Yohana katangatsa kalonga, “Nimwona Iloho kohulumka kulawa kulanga ka njiwa, kakala mchanya mwake. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Na nene tsasimmanyile baye, lekeni ayula iyanitumile kubatitsa kwa ghamatsi kanongela, ‘Imunu yutsomwona Iloho komhulumkila na kukala mchanya mwake, ayo yuyo iyatsobatitsa kwa Iloho Mtakatifu’. <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Na ichinu acho nene nichona, na nene nakona ghendo kuwa ayuno yuyo Imwana wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanafunzi wa mwanduso wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Litsuwa liwinzile, Yohana tsakema bahala keli na weli wa iwanafunzi wake. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Kamwona Yesu kobita, kalonga, “Mlole! Imwanang'olo wa Imulungu!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Iwanafunzi awala weli hawamuhulike Yohana kolonga apfo, wamuwinza Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu kahunduka, kawona womuwinza, kawaghutsa, “Choni chambama?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Wedika, “Rabi, ukala kwani?” (Rabi mana yake Mlangulitsi).<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Kawedika, “Mtse mwone.” Waghenda, wona hanu hayang'ali yokala. Nawo wakala naye litsuwa alila, nayo tsaikala ka saa kumi nemihe.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andeleya, ndughu yake Simoni Petiri, kakala yumwe wa iwanu awala weli iwahulike achila chiyalongile Yohana, na iwamuwinzile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Bahala, Andeleya kambama indughu yake Simoni, kamlongela, “Tumwona Masiya, mana yake Kiristu!” <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Kuya Andeleya kamghala Simoni kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesu kamlola kalonga, “Ghweghwe kwa Simoni imwana wa Yohana. Kutsokemighwa Kefa.” Kefa kwa Chigiriki Petiri, na Petiri mana yake Bwe.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema Filipo na Nathanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />L itsuwa liwinzile Yesu kalamla kughenda Galilaya. Kamwona Filipi, kamlongela, “Niwinze!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipi tsakakala munu wa isi ya Betisaida, isi yawang'ali wokala Andeleya na Petiri. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipi kamwona Nasanaeli, kamlongela, “Tumwona imunu ayula iyandikighwe mbuli tsake na Musa mna ichitabu cha Ghamalaghitso, mbaka manabii wandika tsimbuli tsake. Ayo yuyo Yesu, imwana wa Yosefu. mnu wa wa Nazareti.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nasanaeli kaghutsa, “Apfi yodahika chinu chochose chinoghile chilawile Nazareti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filipi kamwidika, “Utse wone.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu hayamwonile Nasanaeli komtsila, kalonga, “Ayuno Muisiraeli kweli kweli, mghati mwake mduhu ghubu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nasanaeli kamghutsa, “Angu unimanyiletsa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesu kamwidika, “Ng'ana Filipi yakukeme, haukalile hasi ha ghumtini, tsanikwona.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Kuya Nasanaeli kalonga, “Mlangulitsi, (nakwona) ghweghwe kwa Imwana wa Imulungu! Ghweghwe kwa imfalume wa Isiraeli!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu kedika, “Kwotoghola kwaapfila nikulongela tsanikwona haukalile hasi ha ghumtini? Lelo kutsakwona makulu kubita agho.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Kuya kaghendelela kuwalongela, “Nolongesa ghendo, mtsakwona lilanga lyopfughuka na wamalaika wa Imulungu wogheluka na kuhulumka mchanya mwa Imwana wa Adamu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Ichihungo cha ukukwela ako Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Litsuwa lya kadatu hambele, tsakukala na chihungo cha ukukwela ako Kana, mna isi ya Galilaya. Na mamo wake Yesu tsakabaho. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu na iwanafunzi wake nawo pfipfila tsawakemighwa mna ichihungo acho. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Idipfai haimalile, mamo wake kamlongela Yesu, “Wahela idipfai.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu kamwidika, “Mamo, tuna choni cha ukutenda nene na ghweghwe? Isaa yangu ng'ana ipfike baye!”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Kuya mamo wake kawalongela iwatumighwa, “Chochose chiyowalongelani tendeni.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Bahala tsahana mabigha gha mabwe sita gha ghamatsi, ighekighwe kwa ajili ya ichihendo cha Wayahudi cha ukwihopfugha, chila bigha lyodaha kumema galoni ishilini mbaka salasini. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu kawalaghitsa iwatumighwa, “Memetseni ghamatsi mna ghamabigha agho.” Nawo waghamemetsa topu ghendo!<verse eid="JHN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Kuya kawalaghitsa, “Lelo mdeghe, mkamwing'e imkulu wa ichihungo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 2:8">Nawo wadegha, wamghalila. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Naye imkulu wa ichihungo kalanza ghamatsi ighaghaluke kuwa dipfai, wala ng'amanyile baye kwailawile, lekeni iwatumighwa iwadeghile ghamatsi tsawamanya. Kuya imkulu ayo kamkema immale iyokwela hambalimbali, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />kamlongela, “Chila munu kandusagha ukulapfa idipfai inoghile, kuya iwanu hawakuwa wapatika, kolapfa lilusu. Lekeni ghweghwe kuyika idipfai inoghile mbaka sambi!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ichinu achino cha mwanduso cha ukukangawatsa Yesu kachitenda ako Kana, mna isi ya Galilaya; kalangusa utunitso wake, na iwanafunzi wake wamtoghola.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Hambele Yesu na mai wake, hamwe na ndughu tsake na iwanafunzi wake wahulumka waghenda Kaperinaumu. Wakala ako matsuwa chidogho.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowawinga iwanu mna Lihekalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:12-13">Mat 12:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Malk 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Ipasaka ya Wayahudi haikalile habehi, Yesu kagheluka kaghenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Mna Lihekalu, Yesu kawapfika iwanu woutsa ng'ombe, wang'olo na njiwa, na wanu wangi wakala hana tsimetsa wobadili tsisendi.<figure style="fig" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" ref="2:14">Imunu iyobadili tsisendi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Yesu kabota chiboko chikulu cha mitsabi, kawawinga iwanu wose mna Lihekalu, hamwe na wang'olo na wang'ombe. Pfipfila katsibidula tsimetsa tsa iwobadili tsisendi na kutsipwililisa tsisendi tsawo. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Kuya kawalongela iwanu iwang'ali woutsa wanjiwa, “Pfilapfeni pfilawe ahano ipfinu apfino! Mleke kulitenda lihekalu lya Aba wangu kuwa ghulilo.”<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Iwanafunzi wake wakumbuka ichandikighwe, “Wipfu wa ing'anda yako utsonihinya.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Kuya iwakulu wa Wayahudi wamghutsa Yesu, “Apfi udaha kutenda chinu chachi cha kukangawatsa kutulangusa ka kuna uwetso wa ukutenda agha ghose?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu kawedika, “Muimwaghe Ing'anda aino ya Imulungu, nene nitsoitsenga keli kwa matsuwa madatu!”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Iwakulu wa Wayahudi wamwidika, “Ing'anda aino ya Imulungu itsengighwa kwa miyaka alubaini na sita, naghwe utsoitsengatse kwa matsuwa madatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Lekeni Ing'anda ya Imulungu iyang'ali yoilonga Yesu tsaikala ilukuli lwake. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Apfo, hayatsihiluke, iwanang'ina wake wakumbuka achila chayalongile. Kuya waghatoghola Ghamaandiko na waitoghola imbuli aila iyalongile Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koimanya imimoyo ya iwanu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesu hayang'ali Yerusalemu mna Ichihungo cha pasaka, wanu wengi wona ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfayang'ali yotenda, wamtoghola. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Lekeni Yesu tsang'awehuwile baye, kwaapfila tsakawamanya iwanu wose. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Ng'abamile baye munu wowose yamlongele mbuli tsa iwanu, kwaapfila Yesu tsakamanya ighali mghati mwa ghumoyo ghwa imunu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Lelo kukala na munu yumwe wa Mafarisayo, mkulu wa Wayahudi, iyakemighwe Nikodemu. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Chilo chimwe, kamghendela Yesu, kamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, twomanya ka ghweghwe kwa mlangulitsi yulawile kwa Imulungu. Kwaapfila kuduhu munu wowose iyodaha kutenda pfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfautenda ka Imulungu ng'ali hamwe naye baye.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu kamwidika, “Nokulongela ghendo, kuduhu munu iyodaha kuwona ufalume wa Imulungu ka ng'elekighwe keli baye.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemu kamghutsa, “Apfi imunu mbala yodahatse kwelekighwa keli? Pfihi munu kodaha kwingila munda mwa mai wake mala ya kabili na kwelekighwa?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu kamwidika, “Nokulongela ghendo, imunu ka ng'elekighwe baye kwa ghamatsi na kwa Iloho Yelile ng'odaha baye kwingila mna ufalume wa Imulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Ichelekighwe kwa lukuli acho lukuli, na ichelekighwe kwa Iloho Yelile acho loho. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Uleke kukangawala kwa apfila nokulongela kwobamighwa welekighwe keli. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Libeho lyoduma kokose kwalibama. Kohulika litsi lyake, lekeni ng'umanya baye kwalilawa wala kwalighenda. Apfi pfipfo pfaili kwa chila munu yelekighwe na Iloho Yelile.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemu kamghutsa, “Angu aghano ghodahatse kulawila?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwa mlangulitsi wa Isiraeli, aghano ng'ughamanya baye? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Nokulongela ghendo, twolonga ipfinu pfatumanya na twowalongela ipfinu pfatwonile, lekeni mwolema ukuutoghola usenga wetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ka niwalongela tsimbuli tsa ipfinu pfili muisi, ng'amtoghola baye, apfi mtsotogholatse hanitsowalongela tsimbuli tsa ipfinu pfili kulanga?” <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Kuduhu munu iyaghendile kulanga ila Imwana wa Adamu, iyatsile kulawa kulanga.<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Ka Musa pfayachinule ichinyagho achila cha inzoka kwa lubiki kunyika, pfipfo Imwana wa Adamu pfayobamighwa yenulighwe, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />ili chila munu iyomtoghola yawe na ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kwaapfila Imulungu tsakaikunda isi yose mbaka kamlapfa Imwanaghe nyalimwe, ili chila munu iyomtoghola yaleke kwagha ila yawe na ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kwaapfila Imulungu tsang'amtumile baye Imwanaghe kuna iwanu yawahighe, ila yawakombole kubitila yeye.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Munu wowose iyomtoghola ng'atsohighighwa baye, lekeni munu wowose iyolema kumtoghola ayo ma kahighighwa, kwaapfila ng'amtoghole baye Imwana nyalimwe wa Imulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Apfi pfipfo iwanu pfawatsohighighwa: Ghumwanga ghutsa muisi, lekeni iwanu wakunda ichisi kubita ghumwanga, kwaapfila ghawotenda tsagheha. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Chila munu iyotenda ighehile koghwihila ghumwanga, ng'akutsa kuna ghumwanga baye, kwaapfila kopfuka aghala ighehile ghayotenda ghatsakoneka. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Lekeni ayula iyotenda ighanoghile kakutsa kuna ghumwanga, ili aghala ghayotenda ghoneke mwatsi ka ghatendighwa kwa kumhulikitsa Imulungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohane Mbatitsa kolonga mbuli tsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Hambele Yesu na iwanafunzi wake waghenda kuna isi ya Yudeya, ako kakala hamwe nawo, na yang'ali yowabatitsa iwanu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Pfipfila Yohana yang'ali yobatitsa ako Ainoni habehi na Salemu, kwaapfila hanu aho tsahana matsi mengi. Iwanu wang'ali womghendela, naye yang'ali yowabatitsa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Ghamatsuwa agho Yohana tsakakala ng'ana yohighwe baye mchifungo.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Kuya wanafunzi wamwe wa Yohana wang'ali weghutsaghutsa na Myahudi yumwe kwa mbuli ya ukwihopfugha na kutenda iwanu wele. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Apfo wamghendela Yohana, wamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, imunu ayula iyakalile naghwe kumwambu kwa ghumtoyoridani, ayula yulongile ghoya tsimbuli tsake, sambi kobatitsa na iwanu wose womghendela yeye.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohana kawedika, “Kuduhu munu iyodaha kubokela chinu chochose ka ng'eng'ighwe baye na Imulungu iyali kulanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Mwemwe muwenyegho mwa wakalangama haniwalongele, ‘Nene sili Kiristu baye, ila nene nitumighwa nimlongolele.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Iyali na ipinga iyokwelighwa, ayo yuyo immale iyomkwela. Sale wake immale iyokwela kombeta na komtegheletsa, kodeng'elela hayohulika litsi lyake. Apfo sambi apfino indeng'elo yangu itimila. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Yeye kobamighwa yawe mkulu ng'ani, na nene niwe mdodo ghendo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayula iyolawila kulanga mkulu kubita wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Yeye iyakutsa kulawa kuchanya kamkulu kubita wose. Ayula iyolawila muisi ayo wa muisi, na kolonga mbuli tsa muisi, ila yeye iyakutsa kulawa kulanga kamkulu kubita wose. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Yeye kolonga chiyonile na chiyahulike, lekeni kuduhu munu iyotoghola tsimbuli tsayolonga. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Lekeni munu wowose iyotoghola usenga wake, katsolonga Imulungu kolongesa. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Iyatumighwe na Imulungu kolonga mbuli tsa Imulungu, kwaapfila Imulungu kommemetsa ghendo Iloho yake. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Baba komkunda Imwanaghe, na kagheka ghose mmoko mwake. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Munu wowose iyomtoghola Imwana kakuwa na ugima wa matsuwa ghose, lekeni munu wowose iyomlema Imwana ng'atsakuwa na ugima baye, ila katsokala mna imaya ya Imulungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga na ipinga Msamaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Yesu hayamanyile kuwa Mafarisayo wahulika ka Yesu yang'ali yowatenda wanu wengi wawe wanafunzi na kuwabatitsa kubita Yohana, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />hata ka Yesu tsa ng'abatitse baye iwanu, ila iwanafunzi wake wawo iwabatitse; <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />baho koka kulawa Yudeya koya Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Mna ghumwanza ghwake tsakabamighwa yabitile Samariya.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Kapfika kuna ghumji ghumwe ghwa Samariya ighukemighwe Sikari, habehi na ghumghunda aghula Yakobu ghuyamwing'ile Yosefu, imwanaghe. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Aho hakala na ichisima cha Yakobu. Kwaapfila Yesu tsakepfa kwa ghumwanza ghwake, kebwagha hasi habehi na ichisima acho. Nayo tsaikala ka saa sita nemisi.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Pinga yumwe Msamariya katsa yadeghe matsi, Yesu kamlongela, “Ungaye ghamatsi nuwe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Iwanafunzi wake tsawaghenda kuna ghumji kughula ichijo.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Ipinga ayo Msamariya kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwa Myahudi, heule unilomba ghamatsi, na nene na pinga Msamariya?” Tsakalonga apfo kwa apfila Wayahudi na Wasamariya ng'awajagha hamwe baye.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu kamwidika, “Ung'amanyile inzawadi iyolapfa Imulungu, naye nani iyokulongela, 'Ngaya ghamatsi nuwe', ung'amlombile yeye, naye yang'akwing'ile ghamatsi gha ugima.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Ipinga ayo kalonga, “ghwe mndewa, kwahela chinu cha kudeghela ghamatsi, na ichisima chighendesa hasi, lelo agho ghamatsi gha ugima ughapatile kwani? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Pfihi ghweghwe kwa mkulu kubita aba wetu Yakobu, iyatwing'ile ichisima achino; yeye imwenyegho kang'wa ghamatsi ghake, na iwanaghe, na wanyama wake?” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu kamwidika, “Chila munu iyakunwa ghamatsi aghano, katsakona ng'ilu keli, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />lekeni munu wowose iyakunwa ghamatsi ghanimwing'a nene, matsuwa ghose ng'atsakona ng'ilu keli baye, ila ghamatsi aghala ghanimwing'a ghatsakuwa mbwibwi mghati mwake, ibwilula ghamatsi ighatsomwing'a ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Ipinga ayo kamlongela, “Ghwe mndewa, ungaye ghamatsi agho, nileke kwona ng'ilu keli, wala ndeke kutsa ahano keli kudegha ghamatsi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu kamlongela, “Ghenda ukamkeme immale wako, utse naye.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Ipinga kamwidika, “Nahela mmale.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu kamlongela, “Kulonga ghoya, haulonga kwahela mmale, <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />kwaapfila tsakuna wamale watano, na ayula yauli naye sambi si mmale wako baye. Chaulongile kulongesa ghendo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Ipinga ayo kamlongela, “Ghwe mndewa, nakwona ghweghwe kwa nabii! <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Iwahenga wetu tsawamuabudu Imulungu hana ichidunda achino, lekeni mwemwe Wayahudi mwolonga ako Yerusalemu kuko kwatubamighwa tukamuabudu Imulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu kamlongela, “Mai utoghole chanilonga, ghamatsuwa ghakutsa iwanu ng'awatsomuabudu baye Baba hana ichidunda achino, wala ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Mwemwe Wasamariya mwoabudu ichinu ng'amchimanyile, lekeni twetwe Wayahudi twoabudu ichinu ituchimanyile, kwaapfila ukombotsi wolawa kwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Lekeni matsuwa ghakutsa, na sambi ghabaha, iwanu wa kweli iwoabudu watsomuabudu Baba kwa kulongotsighwa na Iloho na ukweli, kwaapfila iwanu ka awo wawo Baba wayobama wamuabudu. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Ambe Imulungu Loho, apfo iwanu wake iwomuabudu wobamighwa wamuabudu mna Iloho na ukweli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Ipinga ayo kamlongela, “Nomanya ka Masiya kakutsa, iyokemighwa Kiristu, naye hayatsakutsa katsotulongela ghoya chila chinu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu kamwidika, “Nene yanilonga naghwe, ye yuyo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Baho iwanafunzi wake Yesu woya, nawo wakangawala hawamwonile Yesu kolonga na ipinga. Lekeni kuduhu munu yamghutsile, “Apfi ubama choni?” Au “Heule ulonga naye?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Kuya ipinga ayo kachileka ichia chake cha ghamatsi, koya kuna ghumji, kawalongela iwanu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Mtse mmwone imunu iyanilongele ipfinu pfose pfanitendile. Apfi ayu ng'odaha baye kuwa yuyo Kiristu?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Apfo iwanu walawa kuna ghumji wamghendela Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Ichipindi chicho iwanafunzi wake wang'ali womdedetsa wolonga, “Gwe Mndewa, tanu uje!”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Lekeni kawedika, “Nene nina chijo ing'amchimanyile baye.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Kuya iwanafunzi wake wandusa kwighutsa, “Pfihi hana munu kamghalila chijo?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu kawalongela, “Ichijo changu chicho achino, kusang'ana aghala ghayobama iyanitumile, na kuimalitsa isang'ano yake. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Mwemwe ng'amlonga baye, ‘Ing'ali miyetsi mine, kuya ghamatsuwa gha mapfuno ghopfika?’ Lelo nowalongela, mwinule tsinenge mlole imighunda! Ghamatsawo ghakomala, ghobamighwa ghapfunighwe! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Naye iyopfuna kobokela mshahala na kolunda hamwe ghamatsawo kwaajili ya ugima wa matsuwa ghose, ili imunu iyohanda na imunu iyopfuna wadeng'elele hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Baho halikuwa kweli alila lyawolonga iwanu, ‘Yumwe kohanda, yungi kopfuna.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Nimtumani kupfuna mna imighunda yang'amlimile mwemwe, wanu wangi wasang'ana, namwe mwobweda kwa isang'ano yawo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wasamariya wengi womtoghola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Wasamariya wengi wa ghumji aghula wamtoghola Yesu kwa achila chiyalongile ipinga ayula ka, “Kanongela ipfinu pfose pfanitendile.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Apfo Wasamariya hawamghendele, wamdedetsa yakale nawo, naye kakala ako matsuwa meli.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Wanu wangi wengi watoghola kwa ghamalonga ghake, <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />na wamlongela ipinga ayula, “Sambi totoghola, si kwa achila chulongile ghweghwe chili yeka baye, ila kwaapfila tuhulika twetwe tuwenyegho; na twomanya ka imunu ayuno yuyo ghendo imkombotsi wa isi yose.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya imwana wa ichilongotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Matsuwa meli haghamalile, Yesu kalawa ako kaghenda Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Kwaapfila Yesu imwenyegho tsakalonga, “Nabii ng'otogholighwa baye mna isi yake imwenyegho.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Hayapfikile Galilaya, wagalilaya wambokela, mana tsawaghona ghose ghayatendile Yesu ako Yerusalemu mna ichihungo cha pasaka; kwaapfila nawo tsawaghenda kuna ichihungo acho.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Kuya Yesu kaghenda keli kuna ghumji ghwa Kana ako Galilaya, hanu ahala hayaghaluse ghamatsi kuwa dipfai. Lelo kukala na chilongotsi yumwe yana imwana iyoghula ako Kaperinaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Ichilongotsi ayo hayahulike ka Yesu kapfika ako Galilaya kulawa Yudeya, kamghendela kamlomba yaghende yakamhonye imwanaghe, iyakalile laghalagha mauti.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu kamlongela, “Mwemwe ng'amtoghola ghendo baye bila ukwona ipfitango na ipfihulo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Ichilongotsi ayo kamwidika, “Ghwe Mndewa, hulumka hima ng'ana imwanangu yafe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu kamwidika, “Haya uka, imwanagho kahona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Imunu ayula katoghola alila liyamlongele Yesu, kalawa koka. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Hayang'ali kamnzila kohulumka, ketingana na iwatumwa wake, wamlongela ka imwanaghe kahona.<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Kawaghutsa imwana yahonile saa ngapi, nawo wamlongela, “Jana saa saba nemisi ihoma imleka.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Baho baba ayula katanga ka yiyo isaa aila Yesu hayamlongele, “Imwanagho kahona.” Apfo kamtoghola Yesu, yeye hamwe na iwanu wose wa ikaye yake.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Lelo achino chikala chitango cha keli chayatendile Yesu hayalawile Yudeya kughenda Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya ichimbete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Hambele chidogho, hakala na chihungo cha Wayahudi, naye Yesu kagheluka kaghenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ako Yerusalemu, habehi na lilango ilikemighwe Lango lya Wang'olo, tsahana tsimbu ilikemighwe Betizata kwa Chieburaniya, litsimbu alyo tsa litsungulukighwa na pfibwalu pfitano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Mna ipfibwalu apfo wang'ali wowasa wanu wengi iwatamu, pfipofu, pfimbete, na iwanu iwaholole. Awo wang'ali wobeta ghamatsi ghatibulighwe, <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />kwaapfila malaika wa Imtwatsa yang'ali yohulumkagha mna ghamatsi na kughatibula. Imtamu iyakwandusa kwingila mna ghamatsi ighatibulighwe, tsakahonyighwa utamu wo wose uyali nawo. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Lelo ahala hakala na munu yumwe iyakalile mtamu kwa miyaka selasini na nane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu hayamwonile imtamu ayo kawasa ahala, aku kamanya ka yang'ali yoghula kwa matsuwa mengi, baho kamghutsa, “Pfii kwobama uhone?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Imtamu ayula kamwidika, “Ghwe Mndewa, nahela munu wa kunyingitsa mna litsimbu ghamatsi haghotibulighwa, hanibama kwingila, munu yungi konongolela.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu kamlongela, “Winuke! Sola ichilagho chako uke.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Bahala imunu yula kahona, kasola ichilagho chake, koka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Ichinu achino tsachilawila mna Litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Baho iwakulu wa Wayahudi wamlongela imunu iyahonile, “Leloli tsuwa lya Sabato, ghamalaghitso ghoghoma ghweghwe ukuchiduta ichilagho chako.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Lekeni imunu ayo kawedika, “Imunu iyanitendile nihone yeye iyanilongele, ‘Sola ichilagho chako uke.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Wamghutsa, “Angu imunu iyakulongele usole ichilagho chako uke nani?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Lekeni imunu ayula iyahonile tsang'ammanyile baye imunu iyamuhonetse, kwaapfila iwanu tsawengi na Yesu tsa kenyalabula koka.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Hambele Yesu kampfika imunu ayula mna Ing'anda ya Imlungu, kamlongela, “Tegheletsa, sambi kuhona. Uleke kutenda nzambi, hela chitsokulawila chinu chihile ng'ani.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Kuya imunu ayula koka, kawalongela iwakulu wa Wayahudi ka yamuhonetse tsa Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ugima kubitila Imwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Apfo Wayahudi wandusa kumwihila Yesu, kwa apfila katenda ichinu achino mna Litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu kawalongela, “Aba wangu kosang'ana ghamatsuwa ghose mbaka sambi, lelo na nene pfipfila nosang'ana.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kwa alyo lyayalongile, wapfilongotsi wa Wayahudi wabama ng'ani wamkome, si kwaapfila kalibetsa Litsuwa lya Sabato liliyeka baye, ila tsa pfipfila kamkema Imulungu Aba wake, apfo ketenda imwenyegho keghala na Imulungu.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Imwana wa Adamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu kaghendelela ukulonga, “Nowalongela ghendo, Imwana ng'odaha baye kutenda chinu chochose imwenyego, ila kutenda achila chayomwona Aba wake kotenda, kwa apfila chayotenda Baba, chicho Imwana naye chayotenda. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Kwaapfila Baba komkunda Imwana na komlangusa ghose ghayotenda. Kuya katsomlangusa pfinu pfikulu pfa kusang'ana kubita apfino, ili mwemwe mkangawale. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Ka apfila Baba pfayowatsihilula iwanu iwafile na kuweng'a ugima, pfipfila Imwana komwing'a ugima imunu ayula iyobama kumtenda yawe mgima. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Wala Baba ng'omhigha munu wowose baye, lekeni isang'ano ya ukuhigha kamlekela Imwana, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />ili iwanu wose wamheshimu Imwana ka apfila pfawomheshimu Baba. Ka imunu ng'omheshimu Imwana baye, ayo pfipfila ng'omheshimu Baba iyamtumile baye.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose iyohulika ghamalonga ghangu na kumtoghola ayula iyanitumile kana ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa; naye ng'atsohighighwa baye, mana ayo kaloka lifwa kengila mna ugima. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Nowalongela ghendo, litsuwa lyakutsa na sambi ma lipfika, iwanu iwafile hawatsohulika litsi lya Imwana wa Imulungu, na awala iwaolihulika watsakuyila ugima keli. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Kwa apfila ka Aba imwenyegho pfayali na ugima mgati mwake, pfipfila kamtenda Imwana yawe na ugima mghati mwake. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Naye kamwing'a Imwana uwetso wa ukuhigha, kwa apfila kaimwana wa Adamu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Mleke kukangawala kwa imbuli aino, litsuwa lyakutsa iwanu wose iwafile watsohulika litsi lyake, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />na watsolawa mna ghamakabuli ghawo, awala iwatendile ighanoghile watsotsihulighwa wawe na ugima, na awala iwatendile ighehile watsotsihulighwa wahighighwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Nene sidaha kutenda chinu nimwenyegho baye, nohigha ka apfila pfanihulika, na ukuhigha kwangu kwa haki, kwaapfila sitenda ka pfaanibama nene baye, ila notenda achila chayobama ayula iyanitumile.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakalangama wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Ka nelapfila ukalangama nimwenyegho, ukalangama wangu si wa kutogholeka baye. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Lekeni kuna munu yungi iyolonga tsimbuli tsangu, na nene nomanya ka achila chayolonga kolongesa. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Mwemwe tsamtuma iwanu kwa Yohana, na tsimbuli tsangu tsayalongile tsolongesa. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Nene sibama ukalangama wa imunu baye, ila nolonga alino ili mwemwe mkombolighwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohana tsakakala itala ing'ali ikwaka na kulapfa ghumwanga, namwe tsamghudeng'elela ghumwanga ghwake kwa matsuwa chidogho. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Lekeni nene nina ukalangama mkulu kubita aula wa Yohana, kwa apfila tsisang'ano tsiyangaile Baba nitsimalitse, tsisang'ano tsenyegho tsanisang'ana, tsolapfa ukalangama ka Baba kanituma. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Naye Baba imwenyegho iyanitumile kanilapfila ukalangama. Namwe ng'ana mhulike baye litsi lyake, wala ukulyona liumbo lyake, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />wala ghamalonga ghake ng'amwinagho baye mghati mwenu, kwaapfila ayula iyatumighwe na yeye mwemwe ng'amumtoghola baye <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Mwosoma kwa kughalolesa Ghamaandiko kwaapfila mwofikitsa ka mghati mwake mtsopata ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. Lekeni agho Ghamaandiko ghagho igholonga tsimbuli tsangu! <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Hata apfo, ng'ambama baye ukutsa kuna nene ili muwe na ugima.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Nene sibokela utunitso kwa iwanu baye, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />lekeni nimmanyani mwemwe ka ukukunda kwa Imulungu mmwahela mna imimoyo yenu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Nene nitsa kwa litaghwa lya Aba wangu, namwe ng'amnibokele baye, lekeni munu yungi yang'atsa kwa litaghwa lyake imwenyegho, ayo mtsombokela. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Apfi mtsodahatse ukutoghola, mwemwe yambama kubokela utunitso kulawa kuna mwemwe iwenyegho, aku utunitso iulawa kwa Imulungu yaliyeka ng'amuubama baye? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Wala mleke kufikitsa ka nitsowalongeletsa kwa Baba, lekeni Musa yammwikile lilolelo lyenu, ayo yuyo iyatsowalongeletsa. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Tsamng'amtoghole Musa, mng'anitoghole na nene, kwaapfila yeye tsakandika tsimbuli tsangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Lekeni ka ng'amchitoghola baye achila chiyandike, angu mtsodahatse kutoghola ghamalangulitso ghangu?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'a chijo wanu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Malk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Agho haghabitile Yesu kaloka kumwambu mwa litsimbu lya Galilaya au litsimbu lya Tiberiya. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Kingili kulu lya iwanu limuwinza kwaapfila tsawona ipfihulo pfayatendile pfa ukuwahonya iwatamu. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Kuya Yesu kagheluka kuchidunda, naye ako kakala hasi hamwe na iwanafunzi wake. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Na ichihungo cha Ipasaka ya Wayahudi chikala chahabehi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu hayenule tsinenge kona mtingano mkulu ghwa iwanu womtsila, kamghutsa Filipi, “Tudaha kughula kwani pfighate tuweng'e iwanu awano waje?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yesu tsakaghutsa apfino kumghetsa Filipi, kwaapfila tsakamanya chayafikitse ukutenda.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipi kamwidika, “Hata fetsa dinari miya mbili ng'atsidaha baye kughula pfighate chila imunu yapate ngaa chidogho!”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Mwanafunzi yungi wa Yesu, Andereya, ndughu yake Simoni Petiri, kamlongela Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Ahano hana msongolo yumwe, kana pfighate pfitano pfa shayiri na somba weli, lekeni apfo pfitsowenelatse iwanu wengi kama awano?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu kalonga, “Walongeleni iwanu wakale hasi.” Hanu ahala tsahana mitsani mingi. Baho iwanu wakala hasi, na ihesabu yawo tsayopfika iwamale kama elufu tano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Baho Yesu kasola ipfighate apfila, kalonga, mighede kwa Imulungu, kawagholela iwanu iwakalile hasi mbaka wose wenela. Na kwa wasomba atenda pfipfo. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Iwanu wose haweghutile, kawalongela iwanafunzi wake, “Dondoleni ipfihande pfa ipfighate ipfikalile, chochose chileke kwagha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Apfo wapfidondola, wamemetsa pfiseghe kumi na pfili, kulawa mna ipfighate apfila pfitano pfa ishayiri iwanu pfiwajile.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Iwanu hawonile ichihulo ichitendighwe na Yesu, wandusa kulonga, “Kweli ghendo ayuno yuyo inabii iyakutsa muisi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Kuya Yesu kamanya kuwa iwanu tsawabama watse wamghoghe wamtende yawe mfalume, apfo kagheluka keli kuchidunda yeye yaliyeka.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghenda mchanya mwa ghamatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-23">Mat 14:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Malk 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Litsuwa haliswele, iwanafunzi wake Yesu wahulumka mbaka kuna litsimbu, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />wadina mnumbwi waloke litsimbu waghende Kaperinaumu. Lelo kukala na chisi, na Yesu tsakakala ng'ana yawatsile baye. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Beho kulu lyanza ukuduma, na kutibula ghamatsi. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Wanafunzi wake hawaghendile utali wa kilomita tano au sita apfino, wamwona Yesu koghenda mchanya mwa ghamatsi, kakutsa habehi na ghumnumbwi, wapfuka ng'ani. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Lekeni Yesu kawalongela, “Ayo nene, mleke kupfuka!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Kuya wabama wambokele mna ghumnumbwi, bahala ghumnumbwi ghupfika kuna ufuo kwawabamile ukughenda.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wombama Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Litsuwa liwinzile, likingili lya iwanu ilikalile kumwambu mwa litsimbu watanga kuwa jana tsa kukala na mnumbwi ghumwe ghuliyeka, na Yesu ng'engile baye mna ghumnumbwi agho hamwe na iwanafunzi wake, ila iwanafunzi wake woka waliyeka. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Kuya minumbwi ingi ilawile Tiberiya tsaipfika habehi na hanu ahala iwanu hawajile ipfighate, Imndewa hayalongile mighede. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Iwanu hawamanyile ka Yesu na iwanafunzi wake ng'awalibaho baye hanu ahala, wengila mna iminumbwi waghenda Kaperinaumu kumbama Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yuyo ichijo cha ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Iwanu hawamwonile Yesu ubali ungi wa litsimbu, wamghutsa, “Mlangulitsi, apfi ahano upfikile tsuwachi?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongelani ghendo, mwemwe mwonibama si kwaapfila mwona ipfihulo baye, ila kwaapfila mja ipfighate mwighuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Mleke kuchisang'anila ichijo ichikola, lekeni mchisang'anile ichijo ichikala kwa ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose, ichijo chayatsomwing'ani Imwana wa Adamu, kwaapfila ayo yeye Baba Imlungu iyamsaghule na kumtoghola.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Kuya wamghutsa Yesu, “Apfi tutende choni ili tutende achila chayobama Imulungu tuchitende?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu kawedika, “Achino ichinu chayobama Imulungu mtende, mumtoghole ayula iyamtumile.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Apfo wamghutsa, “Angu chihulo chachi chausang'ana ili tuchone tukutoghole? Utsotenda choni? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Iwabala wetu waja mana kunyika; ka pfayandikighwe mna Ghamaandiko, ‘Kaweng'a ichijo kulawa kulanga waje.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ghendo, si Musa baye iyoweng'a ichijo kulawa kulanga, ila Aba wangu yuyo iyoweng'a ichijo cha kweli kulawa kulanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kwaapfila ichijo cha Imulungu yuyo ayula iyakutsa kulawa kulanga na kuweng'a ugima iwanu iwali muisi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Wamlongela, “Ghwe Mndewa, utwing'e ichijo achino matsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Nene na ichijo cha ugima, ayula iyakutsa kuna nene ng'atsakwona nzala baye, na ayula iyonitoghola nene ng'atsakwona ng'ilu baye ghendo. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Lekeni nowalongela, Mmbona, lekeni ng'ambama kunitoghola baye. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Wose wayongaya Aba watsakutsa kuna nene, na imunu wowose iyonitsila, nene sitsomwasa kunze baye. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Kwaapfila nene sihulumke kulawa kulanga ili nitende pfanibama nimwenyegho baye, ila kutenda pfayobama ayula iyanitumile. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Na achino chicho chiyobama ayula iyanitumile, ndeke kumwaghitsa munu wowose mna iwanu awala wayangaile, ila nimtsihilule mna litsuwa lya utsighilo. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kwaapfila Aba wangu kobama chila imunu iyomlola Imwana na kumtoghola yawe na ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose, na nene nitsomtsihilula mna litsuwa lya utsighilo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Wayahudi wandusa kumnung'unikila kwaapfila kalonga, “Nene na ichijo ichihulumke kulawa kulanga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Walonga, “Apfi ayuno si Yesu imwana wa Yosefu baye, yatummanya aba wake na mai wake? Lelo yodahatse kulonga, ‘Nihulumka kulawa kulanga?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mleke kwinung'unikila. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Kuduhu munu iyodaha kunitsila nene ka Aba iyanitumile ng'amkweghile baye, na nene nitsomtsihilula mna litsuwa lya utsighilo. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Yandikighwa mna ipfitabu pfa manabii, ‘Iwanu wose watsolangulitsighwa na Imulungu.’ Chila munu iyomtegheletsa Aba na kwilangulitsa kuna yeye katsakutsa kuna nene. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Silonga ka kuna munu kamwona Baba baye, ila ayula iyalawile kwa Imulungu, ayo yuyo yaliyeka iyamwonile Baba. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Nowalongela ghendo, munu wowose iyotoghola kana ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghomala. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Nene na ichijo cha ugima. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Iwabala wenu waja imana kunyika lekeni wafa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Achino chicho ichijo ichihulumka kulawa kulanga'ili imunu yachisole yachije, yaleke ukufa. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Nene na ichijo ichili na ugima, ichihulumke kulawa kulanga; imunu yang'aja ichijo achino, katsokala mgima ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa; na ichijo chanilapfa nene lulo ilukuli lwangu, kwa ajili ya ugima wa iwanu wa isi yose.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Kuya Wayahudi wandusa ukwisonga iwenyegho, weghutsa, “Apfi imunu ayuno yodahatse kutwing'a ilukuli lwake tuluje?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Apfo Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela kweli ghendo, ka ng'amkuja baye ilukuli lwa Imwana wa Adamu na kuinwa idamu yake, ng'amkuwa na ugima baye mghati mwenu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Imunu iyoluja ilukuli lwangu, na kuinwa idamu yangu, ayo kana ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghomala, na nene nitsomtsihilula mna litsuwa lya utsighilo. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kwaapfila ilukuli lwangu lulo ichijo cha kweli, na idamu yangu iyo cha ukunwa cha kweli. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Imunu wowose iyoluja ilukuli lwangu, na kuinwa idamu yangu, ayo koghendelela ukukala mghati mwangu, na nene nokala mghati mwake. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Ka apfila Baba iyali na ugima pfayanitumile, na kwaajili ya Aba nene nokala mgima, pfipfo imunu iyondiya nene katsokala mgima kwaajili yangu nene. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Achino chicho ichijo ichihulumke kulawa kulanga, si ka imana iwajile iwabala wenu kuya wafa. Lekeni imunu iyakuja ichijo achino katsokala mgima matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu kaghalonga agho hayang'ali yolangulitsa mna lisinagogi ako Kaperinaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli tsa Ghamatsuwa Ghose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Wanu wengi mna iwanafunzi wake hawahulike apfo, walonga, “Ghamalangulitso aghano makomu. Apfi yuhi iyodaha kughatoghola?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Kuduhu munu iyamlongele Yesu ichinu chawang'ali wonung'unika iwanang'ina wake, lekeni yeye tsakamanya, apfo kawaghutsa, “Ule ghamalangulitso aghano ghoghetsa ukutoghola kwenu? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Lelo itsakuwatse hamtsomwona Imwana wa Adamu kakuya kulanga, ako kwayakalile mwanduso? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Iloho ya Imulungu iyo ighela ugima, ilukuli ng'alughetsa chinu baye. Imbuli yaniwalongele iyo iloho, na iyo ugima. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Hata apfo, wangi wenu mng'ali ng'amtoghola baye.” Kwaapfila Yesu tsakamanya kulawa mwanduso tsina nani ing'awotoghola na tsakamanya nani iyatsomhunduka. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Kuya Yesu kalonga keli, “Kwaajili ayo tsaniwalongela kuduhu munu iyodaha kunitsila nene mbaka Baba yamtende yadahe ukunitsila.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kulawa litsuwa alyo iwanafunzi wake wengi woya kuchughu, ng'awamuwinzile kel bayei. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yesu kawaghutsa iwanafunzi wake kumi na weli, “Pfii, namwe pfipfila mwobama kuka?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petiri kamwidika, “Ghwe Mndewa, tughende kwa nani? Ghweghwe kuna tsimbuli itsa ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Twotoghola na twotanga ka ghweghwe kwa Iyelile wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Kuya Yesu kawedika, “Angu nene siwasaghuleni mwemwe kumi na weli baye? Lekeni yumwe wenu kasetani.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesu tsayang'ali yolonga mbuli tsa Yuda, imwana wa Simoni Isikarioti, yumwe wa iwanafunzi awala kumi na weli, iyatsomhunduka hambele.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na ndughu tsake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Hambele, Yesu kangila Galilaya; mana ng'abamile kwangila Yudeya baye, kwaapfila wapfilongotsi wa Wayahudi wang'ali wombama wamkome. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Lelo ichihungo cha Wayahudi cha Ipfibumbulika tsa chahabehi, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />apfo wandughu tsake wamlongela, “Ulawe ahano ughende Yudeya, ili iwanafunzi wako wone ipfihulo pfausang'ana. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Kuduhu munu iyopfisa aghala ghayotenda aku kobama yamanyike na iwanu. Kwaapfila ghweghwe kwotenda ipfinu apfino, wilanguse kwa iwanu wa isi yose.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Mana hata wandughu tsake tsang'awamtoghole baye.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu kawalongela, “Ghumda ghwangu nene ng'ana ghupfike baye, lekeni ghumda ghwenu mwemwe ghwabaho matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Iwanu wa isi ng'awodaha kuwehilani mwemwe baye, lekeni wonyihila nene kwaapfila nolangusa ka aghala ghawotenda gheha. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Ghelukani mwemwe mghende kuna ichihungo. Nene sigheluka nighende baye kuna ichihungo achino, kwaapfila ghumda ghwangu ng'ana ghupfike baye.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Hayalongile alyo, kaghendelela ukukala kuko Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mna Ichihungo cha Ipfibumbulika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Wandughu tsake hawagheluke na kughenda kuna ichihungo, baho naye Yesu kagheluka kaghenda, lekeni ng'aghendile mwatsimwatsi baye, ila kaghenda kwa chipfiso. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Lelo iwakulu wa Wayahudi wang'ali wombama ako kuna ichihungo, waghutsa, “Apfi yalikwani imunu ayula?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Mna likingili, iwanu wang'ali wenong'onetsa tsimbuli tsake. Wanu wangi walonga, “Imunu ayuno kanogha;”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:12">Na wangi walonga, “Mbe, ila kowabugha iwanu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Lekeni kuduhu munu iyadahile kulonga mbuli yake yoyose mwatsimwatsi, kwaapfila wang'ali wowapfuka iwakulu wa Wayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolangulitsa mna Ichihungo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ichihungo haching'ali haghatighati Yesu kagheluka kuna lihekalu, kandusa ukufundisa. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Iwakulu we Wayahudi wakangawala, walonga, “Apfi imunu ayuno yaghapatiletsa ghamalangulitso aghano, naye ng'asomile baye?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu kawedika, “Ghamalangulitso ghanilangulitsa si ghangu baye, ila gholawa kwa ayula iyanitumile. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Munu wowose yang'asaghula ukutenda pfayobama Imulungu, katsomanya ka ghamalangulitso ghangu gholawa kwa Imulungu au nolonga ghakwangu nimwenyegho. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Imunu iyolonga mbuli tsake imwenyegho kobama utunitso wake imwenyegho, lekeni imunu iyobama utunitso wa ayula iyamtumile ayo kawakweli, kuduhu ughutsu mna yeye. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Apfi Musa ng'aweng'ile Ghamalaghitso baye? Lekeni mna mwemwe kuduhu munu iyokinda Ghamalaghitso. Hebali mbama mnikome?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Likingili lya iwanu limwidika, “Ghweghwe kuna chinyamkela; yuhi iyobama yakukome?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu kawedika, kalonga, “Nene nitenda chihulo chimwe, namwe wose mkangawala. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa tsakamlaghitseni muwengitse ngoma iwanenu, hata ka si Musa baye ila iwabala wenu iwanduse ichihendo acho, namwe mwomwingitsa ngoma imunu hata mna Litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Ka mwomwingitsa ngoma imunu mna Litsuwa lya Sabato ili kukindilisa Ghamalaghitso gha Musa, hebali mkwona maya kwaapfila nimhonetsa imunu mna Litsuwa lya Sabato? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mleke kuhigha kwa ukulola kuliyeka, ila muhighe kwa haki.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apfi ayuno yuyo Kiristu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Baho wanu wangi wa Yerusalemu wandusa kwighutsa, “Apfi si imunu ayuno baye iwombama wamkome? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Lola! Kolonga mwatsimwatsi ghendo, wala ng'awomlongela chinu baye. Semeghe iwakulu womanya ghendo ka ayu yuyo Kiristu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Lekeni imunu ayuno kwayolawila twetwe twomanya, ila Kiristu hayatsakutsa kuduhu munu iyatsomanya yolawila kwani.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Apfo Yesu hayang'ali yolangulitsa mna lihekalu, kalonga kwa kukemelela, “Ona, nene mwonimanya, na mwomanya kwnilawila kwani. Nene sitsile kwa kubama nimwenyegho baye, lekeni iyanitumile ka ukweli, na mwemwe ng'amummanyile baye, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />lekeni nene nimmanya kwaapfila nilawila kuna yeye, naye yuyo iyanitumile.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Baho wabama wamghoghe, lekeni kuduhu munu iyagholose ghumoko ghwake kumghogha, kwaapfila litsuwa lyake tsang'ana lipfike baye. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Lekeni wanu wengi kulawa mna likingili wamtoghola, walonga, “Pfihi Kiristu hayatsakutsa katsotenda pfihulo pfingi kubita imunu ayuno?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wabetetsi wotumighwa wamghoghe Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafarisayo wahulika iwanu pfawonong'ona tsimbuli tsa Yesu. Apfo iwatambika wakulu na Mafarisayo wawatuma iwabetetsi wakamghoghe. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Baho Yesu kawalongela, “Nokala namwe kwa matsuwa chidogho, kuya nitsakuka nighende kwa ayula iyanitumile. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Mtsonibama, lekeni ng'amtsombona baye, kwaapfila ng'amdaha baye kutsa hanu hanili nene.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Pfilongotsi wa Wayahudi welongela iwenyegho, “Angu imunu ayuno yatsoghenda kwani mbaka tuleke kumwona? Pfii katsoghenda kuna tsikaye tsa Wagiriki kwawokala iwanu wetu, na kuwalangulitsa Wagiriki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Apfi tsayana mana yachi hayalongile, ‘Mtsonibama, lekeni ng'amtsombona,’ na ‘ng'amdaha kutsa hanu hanili nene baye’?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghumto ighulapfa ghamatsi gha Ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Mna litsuwa lya utsighilo na litsuwa likulu lya ichihungo, Yesu kema, kakemelela, “Munu wowose yana ing'ilu, yatse kuna nene yanwe. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Munu wowose iyonitoghola nene, ka Ghamaandiko pfagholonga, ‘Imito ya ghamatsi ighoghela ugima itsakwitika kulawa mghati mwake.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Aho tsayang'ali yolonga mbuli tsa Iloho, yawatsombokela iwanu awala iwomtoghola. Mbaka litsuwa alila Iloho tsayang'ali ng'ana yalapfighwe baye, kwaapfila Yesu tsakakala ng'ana yatsihiluke baye na kutunitsighwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwighola kwa iwanu kwaajili ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Hawahulike ghamalangulitso agho, wanu wangi mna ghumtingano walonga, “Kweli ghendo imunu ayuno yuyo inabii ayula.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Wanu wangi walonga, “Ayuno yuyo Kiristu!.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Lekeni wanu wangi wang'ali weghutsa, “Pfihi Kiristu kodaha kulawa Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Apfi Ghamaandiko ng'aghalongile baye kama Kiristu katsolawila mlukolo lwa Daudi, na kulawa Betilehemu, ghumji ghuyakalile Daudi?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Apfo iwanu tsawebaghula kwaajili yake. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Wanu wangi wabama kumghogha, lekeni kuduhu munu iyamgholosele ghumoko.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwakulu wa Wayahudi wolema ukumtoghola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Baho iwakalitsi wa lihekalu woya kwa iwakulu wa iwatambika na Mafarisayo, nawo wawaghutsa, “Hebari ng'amumghoghile?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Nawo wawedika, “Ng'ana munu wowose yalonge kama imunu ayuno pfayolonga!” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Kuya Mafarisayo wedika, “Pfihi namwe pfipfila mbughighwa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Kuna mkulu wowose iyomtoghola? Au yumwe wa Mfarisayo iyomtoghola? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Lekeni likingili alino lya iwanu ing'awomanya Ghamalaghitso gha Musa, walighitighwa.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodemu, Farisayo miyao, ayula tsaiyamghendele Yesu aho mwanduso, kawalongela, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Apfi Ghamalaghitso ghetu ghomhigha imunu wowose ka ng'ana tumhulikitse na kumanya chayatendile?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Wamwidika, “Pfihi naghwe kolawa Galilaya? Lola Ghamaandiko, kutsomanya ka kuduhu nabii iyolawila Galilaya.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Kuya chila munu koka ukaye yake.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Ipinga iyaghoghighwe ughoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Lekeni Yesu kaghenda kuna ichidunda cha Minzeituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Nemitondotondo litsuwa lya keli Yesu koya kengila keli kuna lihekalu. Iwanu wose wamtsila, naye kakala hasi, kandusa kuwalangulitsa. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Baho Iwaandishi na Mafarisayo wamghalila pinga iyaghoghighwe ughoni, wamwika ipinga ayo haghatighati hawo. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Wamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, ipinga ayuno kaghoghighwa ughoni, hayang'ali yowasa na immale. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mna Itorati, Musa katulaghitsa ipinga ka ayu kobamighwa yatowighwe na ghamabwe. Na ghweghwe ulongatse?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Lekeni tsawaghutsa apfo wamghetse na wamwonze, ili wapate ghomba lya kumshitaki. Lekeni Yesu kenamila hasi, kandusa kwandika mna lidongo kwa ichidole chake.<verse eid="JHN 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Hawaghendelele kumghutsa, Yesu kenula litwi kawalongela, “Imunu wowose mna mwemwe yang'ana yatende chinu chihile yalongole ukumwasila libwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Kuya Yesu kenama keli, kandika mna lidongo. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Iwanu awala hawahulike apfi, wandusa kuka yumweyumwe, kwandusila iwabala. Yesu kasighala yaliyeka na ipinga ayula iyemile ahala. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu kenula litwi, kamghutsa, “Walikwani iwanu iwakughoghile? Pfihi kuduhu munu iyakuhighile?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Ipinga ayo kamwidika, “Mndewa, kuduhu munu iyanihighile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesu kamlongela, “Na nene sikuhigha baye. Uka, na uleke kutenda nzambi keli.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kaghumwanga ghwa isi yose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu kalonga keli na iwanu, kalonga, “Nene na ghumwanga ghwa isi. Munu wowose iyoniwinza nene ng'atsakwanga mchisi baye, ila katsakuwa na ghumwanga ghwa ugima.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Mafarisayo wamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwelapfila ukalangama ghumwenyegho, ukalangama wako si wa kweli baye.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu kawalongela, “Hata kama nelapfila ukalangama nimwenyegho, ukalangama wangu wolongesa, kwaapfila nomanya kwani kwanilawile na kwani kwanighenda. Lekeni mwemwe ng'ammanya baye kwani kwanilawile au kwanighenda. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Mwemwe mwohigha ka iwanu pfawohigha. Nene simhigha munu baye. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Lekeni hata ning'ahigha, nohigha ghoya, kwaapfila sisang'ana niliyeka baye, Aba iyanitumile kahamwe na nene. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Yandikighwa mna Ghamalaghitso ghenu kuwa ukalangama wa wanu weli wotogholighwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Nene nelapfila nimwenyegho ukalangama, na imkalangama wangu yungi, Baba iyanitumile.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Kuya wamghutsa, “Ayo Aba wako yali kwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu kawedika, “Nene ng'amnimanyile baye, wala Aba wangu ng'amummanyile baye; mng'animanyile nene, na Aba wangu pfipfila mng'ammanyile.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Tsimbuli atsino Yesu kalonga hayang'ali yolangulitsa mna lihekalu, hana ichumba cha ihatsina. Na haduhu munu iyamghoghile, kwaapfila isaa yake tsa ng'ana ipfike baye.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwanighenda nene mwemwe ng'amdaha kughenda baye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu kalonga nawo keli, “Nene nakuka, namwe mtsonibama; na mtsakufa mna tsinzambi tsenu. Kwanighenda nene mwemwe ng'amdaha kughenda baye.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Iwakulu wa Wayahudi waghutsa, “Pfihi kobama yekome imwenyegho? Mana kolonga, 'Kwanighenda nene mwemwe ng'amdaha kughenda baye?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Lekeni Yesu kawedika, “Mwemwe mwa wa hasi, nene na wa kuchanya. Mwemwe mwa iwanu wa isi aino, nene sili wa isi aino baye. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Tsaniwalongela mtsakufa mna tsinzambi tsenu. Kwaapfila ana ng'amtoghola baye kuwa ‘Nene ye yuyo’ mtsakufa mna tsinzambi tsenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Baho wamghutsa, “Lelo ghweghwe uli nani?” Yesu kawedika, “Nene nayuyo kama pfaniwalongele kulawa mwanduso.” <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />“Nina pfinu pfingi pfa kuwalonga mwemwe na kumhighani. Lekeni iyanitumile yeye kawaukweli, na achila chanihulika kuna yeye, chicho chaniwalongela iwanu wa isi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Wala ng'awamanyile baye kuwa Yesu yang'ali yowalongela tsimbuli tsa Baba. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Apfo Yesu kawalongela, “Hamtsomwinula mchanya Imwana wa Adamu, baho hamtsomanya kuwa nene na Yuyo, na kuwa nene sitenda chinu chochose pfanibama nimwenyegho baye, ila chayonilangulitsa Baba chicho chanilonga. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Na ayula iyanitumile kahamwe na nene, ng'anilekile niliyeka baye, kwaapfila matsuwa ghose nene notenda aghala ighomnoghela.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Wengi iwamhulike Yesu hayang'ali yolonga ipfinu apfino wamtoghola.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukweli utsomwikani hulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Apfo Yesu kawalongela Wayahudi awala iwamtoghole, “Mng'aghakinda ghamalangulitso ghangu, mwemwe mtsakuwa wanafunzi wangu ghendo ghendo. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Kuya mtsomanya ukweli, na ukweli utsomwikeni hulu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Nawo wamwidika, “Twetwe twa watsukulu wa Abrahamu, na ng'ana tuwe watumwa wa munu wowose baye. Utulongatse, 'Mtsakwikighwa hulu'?” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela ukweli ghendo, munu wowose iyotenda nzambi ayo mtumwa wa nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mtumwa ng'okala matsuwa ghose hakaye baye, lekeni imwana kokala hakaye matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Apfo Imwana yang'amwikani hulu, mtsakuwa hulu kweli kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Nomanya kuwa mwemwe mwa watsukulu wa Abrahamu. Lekeni mwobama mnikome kwaapfila ng'amtoghola ghamalangulitso ghangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Achila Aba wangu chayanilanguse chicho chaniwalongela, na mwemwe pfipfila achila chayowalongela aba wenu chicho chamtenda.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Wamwidika, “Aba wetu twetwe Abrahamu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu kawedika, “Mng'awile wana wa Abrahamu, mng'atendile aghala ghayatendile Abrahamu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Lekeni lelo mwemwe mwobama mnikome, imunu yaniwalongele ukweli yaniuhulike kwa Imlungu. Abrahamu ng'atendile chinu kama achino baye! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Mwemwe mwotenda tsisang'ano tsa aba wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Baho wamlongela, “Twetwe ng'atwoneke kwa utsinzi baye, twinaye Aba wetu yumwe, yuyo Imlungu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwana wa Setani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu kawalongela, “Imlungu yang'awile Aba wenu, mng'anikundille nene, kwaapfila nilawa kwa Imulungu na sambi na ahano. Sitsile kwa ukubama kwangu nimwenyegho baye, ila yeye kanituma. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Hebali ng'ammanya aghala ghanilonga? Kwaapfila mwemwe ng'amdaha kuhulikitsa ghamalangulitso ghangu baye. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Mwemwe mwa wa aba wenu Ibilisi, na tsitamaa tsa aba wenu tsitso tsamsulukila ukutenda. Yeye kawa mkomi tangia mwanzo, wala ng'emile mna ukweli baye, kwaapfila ng'amna ukweli baye mghati mwake. Hayolonga ughutsu, kolonga gha ichihendo chake, kwaapfila kamghutsu na kababa wa ughutsu. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Na nene kwaapfila nolonga ighali gha ukweli, mwemwe ng'amnitoghola baye. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Apfi nani mna mwemwe iyodaha kulapfa ukalangama ka nene nina nzambi? Kama nowalongela ighali gha ukweli, hebali mlema ukunitoghola? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Imunu iyehuwila Imlungu kohulikitsa usenga wa Imlungu. Lekeni mwemwe ng'amhulikitsa kwaapfila ng'amwihuwila Imlungu baye.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Wayahudi wamwidika, na wamghutsa, “Angu ng'atulongesa baye, hatulonga ka ghweghwe kwa Msamariya na kuna chinyamkela?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu kawedika, “Nene sina chinyamkela baye, ila nomheshimu Aba wangu; lekeni mwemwe mwoniumbula. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Nene sibamila utunitso nimwenyegho baye, ila kabaho iyoubama, na yuyo imlamtsi. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Nowalongela ukweli ghendo, munu wowose yang'aghakinda ghamalangulitso ghangu, ayo ng'atsakufa ghendo baye matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Baho Wayahudi wamlongela, “Lelo twomanya kuwa ghweghwe kuna chinyamkela! Abrahamu na manabii wafa, lekeni ghweghwe kwolonga, munu wowose yang'aghakinda ghamalangulitso ghangu, ayo ng'atsakufa ghendo baye matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Pfihi ghweghwe kwa mkulu kubita aba wetu Abrahamu iyafile? Pfipfila na wamanabii iwafile? Angu ghweghwe kwetenda uli nani?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu kawedika, “Ning'etunya nimwenyegho, utunitso wangu si chinu baye. Aba wangu yuyo iyonitunya nene, yamumkema mwemwe Imlungu wenu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Mwemwe ng'amummanyile baye, lekeni nene nimmanya. Ning'alonga simmanyile baye, nitsakuwa mghutsu kama mwemwe. Lekeni nene nimmanya, na lilonga lyake nolikinda. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Abrahamu, aba wenu, tsa kadeng'elela ng'ani kwa apfila pfayatsolyona litsuwa lyangu, naye kalyona, kadeng'a.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Wayahudi wamlongela, “Ghweghwe ng'una upfike hata miyaka hamsini, naghwe kumwona Abrahamu!”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela kweli ghendo, Ng'ana Abrahamu yawe baho, nene nabaho.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Baho wadondola mabwe wamwasile, lekeni Yesu kepfisa, kenyelebula kalawa mna lihekalu koka.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya imunu iyelekighwe chifita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu hayang'ali yoluta, kamwona munu chifita kulawa ukwelekighwa kwake. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Wanafunzi wake wamghutsa, “Mlangulitsi, yuhi iyatendile nzambi, mbaka imunu ayuno yelekighwe chifita, imunu ayuno au iwamweleke?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu kawedika, “Si imunu ayuno, wala iwamweleke baye iwatendile nzambi, lekeni ilawila apfino ili tsisang'ano tsa Imlungu tsoneke mna ugima wake. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Twobamighwa kusang'ana tsing'onde tsa ayula iyanitumile hakung'ali misi. Chilo chakutsa ng'akutsakuwa na munu iyodaha kusang'ana baye. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Hanili muisi, nene na ghumwanga ghwa isi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Hayamalitse ukulonga apfo, kabwalula ghamate mna lidongo, kapfulugha kododo kwa ghamate aghala, kambaka ichifita mna tsinenge, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />kamlongela, “Ghenda ukehopfughe kuna litsimbu lya Siloamu” (Siloamu mana yake “Iyatumighwe”). Apfo imunu ayula koka kaghenda kwihopfugha, kuya koya aku kakona.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Iwanu iwang'ali wokala naye habehi, na iwanu iwamwonile hayang'ali yolomba weghutsa, “Apfi ayuno si imunu ayula iyang'ali yolomba baye?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Wamwenga walonga, “Ayuno yeye,” wangi walonga, “Ayuno si yeye baye, ila keghala naye.” Lekeni imwenyegho kalonga, “Nene yuyo yaning'ali nilomba.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Apfo wamghutsa, “Apfi tsinenge tsako tsifumbulighwetsa?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Naye kawedika, “Imunu ayula iyokemighwa Yesu kapfulugha kododo kanibakatsa mna tsinenge, kanilongela nighende Siloamu nikanawe. Apfo nighenda, ninawa, na baho nidaha ukwona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Wamghutsa, “Yalikwani imunu ayo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Kawedika, “himanye.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafarisayo womghutsa imunu iyahonyighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Kuya wamghala kwa Mafarisayo imunu ayula iyakalile chifita aho mwanduso. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Na litsuwa alila Yesu hayapfulughe likododo na kumhonya imunu chifita tsalikala Litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Apfo Mafarisayo nawo wamghutsa imunu ayo pfayadahile ukwona. Naye kawalongela, “Kanibakatsa kododo mna tsienge tsangu, ninawa, na sambi nakwona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Mafarisayo wamwenga walonga, “Imunu ayuno ng'alawile kwa Imlungu baye, kwaapfila ng'olikinda baye Litsuwa lya Sabato.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Lekeni wanu wangi waghutsa, “Apfi imunu yana tsinzambi yodahatse kutenda pfihulo kama apfino?” Apfo halawila mpfulughiko, weghola. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Kuya wamghutsa keli imunu ayula chifita, “Ghweghwe umlongatse imunu ayo iyakuhonyile tsinenge?” Naye kawedika, “Kanabii.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Lekeni iwakulu wa Wayahudi ng'awatoghole baye ka imunu ayo tsachifita na kadaha ukwona, mbaka wawakema aba na mai wa imunu ayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Wawaghutsa, “Apfi ayuno yuyo imwanenu, yamlonga kelekighwa chifita, lelo yadahiletsa ukwona?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Aba wake na mai wake wawedika, “Twomanya kama ayuno mwanetu, na tsakelekighwa chifita, <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />lekeni pfayadahile ukwona ng'atummanyile baye, wala imunu iyamhonyile tsinenge twetwe ng'atummanyile ka! Mghutseni yeye, ayu mbala mgima, kodaha kwilongela imwenyegho!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Aba wake na mai wake walonga apfo kwaapfila wang'ali wowapfuka iwakulu wa Wayahudi, kwaapfila tsawalonga munu wowose iyolonga kama Yesu yuyo Kiristu katsowingighwa mna lisinagogi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Kwa ajili ya alyo aba na mai wake walonga, “Ayu mbala mgima, mghutseni yeye.” <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Wamkema keli imunu ayo tsaiyakalile chipofu, wamlongela, “Mwing'e utunitso Imulungu, ulongese! Twetwe twomanya kama imunu ayuno iyakuhonyile kana nzambi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Imunu ayo kawedika, “Kama imunu ayuno kana nzambi au kahela nzambi nene simanya ka!. Chinu chimwe chanimanya, tsanikala nachipofu, lekeni sambi nakona!” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Kuya wamghutsa imunu ayo, “Angu yakutendele choni? Yakufumbuletsa tsinenge?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Imunu ayo kawedika, “Tsanimlongelani lekeni ng'amtegheletse baye. Heule mbama kuhulika keli? Pfihi namwe mwobama muwe wanafunzi wake?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Baho wamligha, walonga, “Ghweghwe kwa mwanafunzi wake imunu ayuno! Lekeni twetwe twa wanafunzi wa Musa! <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Twetwe twomanya kughwa Imlungu tsakalonga na Musa, lekeni imunu ayuno, ng'atumanyile baye kwayolawila kwani!” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Imunu yula kawedika, “Leke baye, nene mwonikangawatsa! Ng'ammanyile baye kwani kwayolawila, aku nene kanihonya tsinenge! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Twomanya ka Imulungu ng'omhulikitsa imunu yana inzambi baye, lekeni imunu iyompfuka na kutenda chayobama ayo komhulikitsa. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kulawa isi haiumbighwe ng'ana ilongighwe ka kuna munu wowose kamhonetsa imunu iyelekighwe chipofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Tsa ka imunu ayuno ng'alawie kwa Imlungu, ng'abamile kudaha kusang'ana chochose baye!” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Nawo wamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwelekighwa mna inzambi ghendo, udahatse kutulangulitsa twetwe?” Apfo wamuwinga kalawa kunze.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upofu wa ghumoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu kahulika ka tsakawingighwa kunze, naye hayamwonile kamghutsa, “Pfihi ghweghwe kwomtoghola Imwana wa Imunu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Imunu ayo kamghutsa, “Ghwemtwatsa, apfi imunu ayo nani? Nongele nimtoghole!” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu kamwidika, “Mala kumwona! Ayo yulonga naye ye yuyo.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Imunu ayo kamwidika, “Ghwemtwatsa, notoghola,” kuya kamwinamila.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu kalonga, “Nene nitsa muisi amno kwa ajili ya ukuhigha, ili awala iwali pfipofu wone, na awala iwakona wawe pfipofua.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mafarisayo wangi iwakalile hamwse na Yesu wamhulika hayalongile apfo, wamghutsa, “Apfi kwolonga na twetwe twa pfipofu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu kawedika, “Mng'awile mwa pfipofu, ng'ambamile kuwa na nzambi baye; lekeni kwaapfila mwolonga mwakona, inzambi yenu yokala namwe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya imdimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela kweli ghendo, imunu yang'akwingila mna ichikwama cha wang'olo kwa kubitila inzila ya lilango, ila kakwingila kwa kudinila hanu hangi, ayo mbapfi na mboka. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Lekeni iyakwingila kubitila inzila ya lilango ayo yuyo imdimi wa wang'olo. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Ayo, imbetetsi wa lilango kompfughulila, na wang'olo wohulikitsa litsi lyake; naye kowakema wang'olo wake kwa ghamataghwa ghawo, na kowalapfa kunze. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Yang'awalapfa kunze wang'olo wake wose kowalongolela, na wang'olo wake womuwinza kwaapfila wolimanya litsi lyake. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Lekeni imunu mhenza ng'awatsomuwinza baye, ila watsomkimbila, kwaapfila ng'awomanya baye litsi lya imunu mhenza.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu kawalongela ing'ungo ayo, lekeni wawo ng'awamanyile baye chinu chachi chayang'ali yowalongela.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamdimi yanoghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Kuya Yesu kalonga keli, “Nowalongela kweli ghendo, nene nalilango lya wang'olo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Iwanu wose iwanilongolele tsawabapfi na waboka, lekeni wang'olo ng'awawahulikitse baye. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Nene nalilango. Munu wowose yang'engila kubitila nene katsokombolighwa. Katsakwingila na kulawa, naye katsopata ghumghina. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Imbapfi kakutsa yebe, yakome, na yahinye; nene nitsa ili wawe na ugima, na wawe nawo tele ghendo.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Nene namdimi iyaninoghile. Mdimi yanoghile kolapfa ugima wake kwa ajili ya wang'olo. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Imunu iyodima kwa kulihighwa, ing'ayali imtwatsa wa wang'olo baye, hayomwona yumbwa wa kumhulo kakutsa, kowaleka wang'olo kotsuma; na yumbwa wa kumhulo kowaghogha na koughima wanguwapwililisa. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Imunu ayo kotsuma kwaapfila yeye kamunu wa kulihighwa, na ng'ohindaghitsa ukulolesa wang'olo baye. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />“Nene namdimi iyaninoghile, nowamanya wang'olo wangu, na wang'olo wangu wonimanya, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />kama apfila Baba pfayonimanya nene, na nene pfanimmanya Baba. Na nene noulapfa ugima wangu kwa ajili ya wang'olo. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Na ng'olo wangi ninawo, iwali si wa ichikwama achino baye, awo pipfila nobamighwa niwaghale kwanyili. Nawo litsi lyangu watsolihulika, na kutsakuwa na kingili limwe na mdimi yumwe.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Kwa ajili ayo Aba wangu konikunda, kwaapfila noulapfa ugima wangu ili niubokele keli. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Kuduhu munu iyoulapfa ugima wangu, ila nene noulapfa nimwenyegho. Uwetso ninawo wa ukuulapfa, na wa kuusola keli. Nibokela laghitso alino kulawa kwa Aba wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Tsimbuli atsino tsa Yesu tsiwatenda Wayahudi weghole keli. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Iwanu wamwenga walonga, “Kana chinyamkela na kana lukwale. Heule mumtegheletsa?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Lekeni wangi walonga, “Imunu yana chinyamkela ng'odaha baye kulonga apfino. Angu chinyamkela kodaha kumuhonetsa imunu chifita?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ako Yerusalemu kukala na Chihungo cha Kulika wakifu lihekalu, na tsaghukala msimu ghwa chipfeghetsi. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Naye Yesu yang'ali yakwanga mna lihekalu, hana ilukumbi lwa Selemani. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Wapfilongotsi wa Wayahudi wamtsunguluka na wamghutsa, “Utsotutsupfatsupfa tsimbutsi tsetu mbaka tsuwachi? Tulongele mwatsimwatsi kama ghweghwe yuyo Kiristu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu kawedika, “Tsaniwalongela, lekeni ng'amtoghola baye. Ipfinu pfanitenda kwa litaghwa lya Aba wangu pfipfo ipfinilangusa, <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />lekeni mwemwe ng'amtoghola baye kwaapfila mwemwe ng'amli wang'olo wangu baye. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Wang'olo wangu wohulika litsi lyangu, na nene nowamanya, nawo woniwinza. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Noweng'a ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa, nawo ng'awatsohupa baye. Kuduhu munu iyodaha kuwaboka mna ghamoko ghangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Baba wangu, iyangaile awo, kamkulu kubita wose, kuduhu munu iyodaha kuwaboka kulawa mna ghamoko gha Aba wangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Nene na Aba twachinu chimwe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Wapfilongotsi wa Wayahudi wadondola keli ghamabwe wamtowe. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu kawalongela, “Niwalangusa sang'ano nyingi itsilawile kwa Aba. Apfi sang'ano ihi iwatenda mnitowe na ghamabwe?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Nawo wapfilongotsi wa Wayahudi wamwidika, “Ng'atukwasila ghamabwe kwaapfila kutenda sang'ano tsinoghile baye, ila kwa ajili ya ukukufulu! Ghweghwe yauli mwanadamu, lekeni kwetenda ghumwenyegho kwa mlungu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu kawedika, “Apfi ng'ayandikihwe baye mna Ghamalaghitso ghenu kuwa Imlungu tsakalonga, ‘Mwemwe mwa milungu?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Kama Imlungu kawakema milungu awala iweng'ighwe lilonga lyake, na Ghamaandiko ng'aghodaha kutengulighwa baye, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />lelo ayula Baba iyamtawatse na kumtuma muisi, mwemwe mwolonga kokufulu, kwaapfila nilonga ‘Nene na lmwana wa Imlungu?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Ana sitenda baye tsisang'ano tsa Aba wangu, mleke kunitoghola, <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />lekeni ana nitsitenda tsisang'ano tsake, hata kama mwolema ukunitoghola, togholeni tsisang'ano atso, ili mmanye na mtange kuwa Baba kamghati mwangu, na nene namghati mwa Baba.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Kuya wabama keli wamghoghe, lekeni Yesu kaswekuka kawaleka.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Kuya Yesu kaghenda keli kumwambu kwa ghumto ghwa Yoridani, hanu ahala Yohane hayang'ali yobatitsa iwanu, kakala kuko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Wanu wengi wamghendela Yesu, na wang'ali wolonga, “Yohane kweli ng'atendile miujitsza baye, lekeni chila mbuli ya imunu ayuno iyalongile Yohane ilongesa.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Na wanu wengi ako wamtoghola Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Lifwa lya Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Lelo munu yumwe iyakemighwe Lazaro tsamtamu. Ayo yang'ali yokala Betaniya, kaye yake Mariya na dada yake Marita. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Mariya ayuno tsakakala yuyula iyambakile Imndewa ghamafuta ighonung'ila mmaghulu, na kughabaghusa kwa tsimvili tsake, yuyo ilumbu wake Lazaro iyakalile mtamu. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Apfo lumbu tsake wamtumila Yesu usenga, “Ghwe Mndewa, sale yako yumkunda koghula.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu hayahulike apfi, kalonga, “Utamu auno si wa lifwa baye, ila ulawila kwa ajili ya utunitso wa Imlungu, ili Imwana wa Imlungu yatunitsighwe kubitila utamu auno.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Naye Yesu tsakawakunda Marita, na lumbu lyake, na Lazaro. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Yesu hayahulike Lazaro koghula, kongetsa matsuwa meli gha ukukala ahala hayakalile. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela wanafunzi wake, “Tukeni keli Yudeya.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Wanafunzi wake wamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, matsuwa chidogho ighabitile wapfilongotsi wa Wayahudi wang'ali wobama wakutowe na ghamabwe, heule ubama ughende ako keli?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu kawedika, “Apfi imisi ng'aina masaa kumi na meli baye? Munu yang'anga nemisi ng'ekwala baye kwa apfila koghwona ghumwanga ghwa isi aino. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Lekeni imunu yang'anga nechilo kekwala, kwa apfila kahela mwanga mghati mwake.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Kaghalonga agho, kuya kaghendelela kuwalongela, “Sale yetu Lazaro kawasa, lekeni nene noghenda nikamlamse.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Wanafunzi wake wamwidika, “Ghwemtwatsa, kama kawasa, katsohona.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Lekeni Yesu tsayang'ali yolonga imbuli ya ukufa kwa Lazaro, ila wawo wafikitsa kolonga imbuli ya ukuwasa tsinongo. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Apfo lelo Yesu kawalongela mwatsimwatsi ghendo, “Lazaro kafa, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />lekeni kwaajili yenu nodeng'elela, kwaapfila sikalile kuko baye, ili mwemwe mtoghole. Lelo tukeni tumghendele.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Kuya Tomasi, iyakemighwe Basa, kawalongela wanafunzi wayaghe, “Na twetwe tukeni, ili tukafe hamwe naye.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yuyo utsihiluko na ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu hayapfikile ako, kampfika Lazaro mala katsikighwa mkabuli matsuwa mane ighalutile. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Ichijiji cha Betaniya tsachikala habehi na Yerusalemu, utali kama wa maili mbili; <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />na Wayahudi wengi tsawatsa kuwakanza Marita na Mariya kwa ukufa kwa indughu yawo. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Marita hayahulike Yesu kakutsa, kaghenda kunze kwitingana na Yesu, lekeni Mariya tsakasighala mng'anda. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Marita kamlongela Yesu, “Ghwemtwatsa, ka ung'awile ahano, lumbu lyangu tsang'abamile kufa baye! <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Lekeni nomanya, hata sambi, ka chochose chaumlomba Imlungu katsokwing'a.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu kamlongela, “Lumbu lyako katsotsihiluka.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marita kamwidika, “Nomanya ka katsotsihiluka mna utsihiluko wa iwafile litsuwa lya utsighilo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu kamlongela, “Nene yuyo utsihiluko na ugima. Imunu iyonitoghola nene, hata yang'afa katsakuwa na ugima keli, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />na imunu wowose iyali mgima na kunitoghola nene ng'atsakufa ghendo baye. Pfihi alyo kwotoghola?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Marita kamwidika, “Ona, Ghwemtwatsa! Notoghola ka ghweghwe kwa Kiristu, Imwana wa Imlungu, ayula iyakutsa muisi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlilila Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Marita hayamalitse ukulonga apfo, kaghenda kamkema Mariya hawaliyeka, kamlongela, “Imlangulitsi kabaha, kokukema.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Mariya hayahulike alyo, kenuka himahima kamghendela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Naye Yesu kakala ng'ana yapfike mkaye baye, ila tsayang'ali bahala hayetingane na Marita. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Wayahudi awala iwakalile mng'anda womkanza Mariya, hawamwonile Mariya kenuka himahima na kulawa kunze wamuwinza, wafikitsa yang'ali yoghenda kuna likabuli yakalile. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Mariya hayapfikile hanu hayali Yesu na hayamwonile, keghwisa imwenyegho hana ghamaghulu ghake, kamlongela, “Ghwemtwatsa, ka ung'awile baha, lumbu lyangu ng'abamile yafe baye!” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu hayamwonile Mariya kolila, na Wayahudi iwatsile na Mariya nawo wolila, iloho yake ihutsunika na kaghanzika mmoyo mwwake. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Yesu kawaghutsa, “Angu mmwikile kwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Wamwidika, “Ghwemtwatsa, itsa ulole.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu kalila. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Kuya Wayahudi walonga, “Loleni pfayamkundile!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Lekeni wanu wangi welongela, “Ayula iyamhonyile imunu chipofu, ng'adahile pfihi ukumtenda na ayuno yaleke ukufa?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komtsihilula Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu, aku koghanzika keli mna ghumoyo ghwake, kaghenda mbaka kuna likabuli. Likabuli alyo tsalikala pango lidiwiighwe na libwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu kawalaghitsa, “Lighubuleni libwe!” Marita, lumbu wa imunu iyafile kamwidika, “Ghwemtwatsa, ng'ambe konung'a! Mana tangu hayatsikighwe leloli tsuwa lya kane.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu kamlongela, “Pfihi sikulongele baye ka ung'atoghola kutsakwona utunitso wa Imlungu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Apfo walighubula libwe. Kuya Yesu kenula tsinenge kalola kuchanya kalonga, “Baba, nolonga mighede kwaapfila kunihulika. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Nomanya kuwa ghweghwe matsuwa ghose konihulika, lekeni nilonga apfino kwaajili ya iwanu iwemile ahano, ili watoghole ka ghweghwe kunituma.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Hayamalitse ukulonga apfino, kakemelela kwa litsi kulu, “Lazaro, utse akuno kunze!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Naye imunu ayula iyafile kalawa kunze, ghamoko na ghamaghulu ghake ghohighwa na isanda, na ichihanga chake chohighwa na chitambala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Yesu kawalongela, “Mdoholeni mumleke yoke.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wobama kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Malk 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Apfo Wayahudi wengi iwaghendile kumwangila Mariya, na kughona aghala ghayatendile Yesu, wamtoghola. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Lekeni wanu wangi waghenda kwa Mafarisayo wawalongela aghala ghayatendile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Kuya Mafarisayo na iwatambika wakulu wakema mtingano ghwa Libalatsa lya Wayahudi, weghutsa, “Tutendatse lelo? Imunu ayuno kotenda miujitsa mingi. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Tung'amleka yaghendelele, iwanu wose watsomtoghola, kuya iwakulu wa Waroma watsakutsa kusola Ing'anda yetu ya ukulombela na litaifa lyetu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Kuya yumwe wawo, iyakemighwe Kayafa, iyakalile Mtambika mkulu wa ghumwaka aghula, kalonga, “Mwemwe mwawabotsi! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Apfi ng'ammanyile baye ka afatsali munu yumwe yafe kwaajili ya iwanu, kuliko litaifa lyose lihinyighwe?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Lekeni tsag'alongile alyo kwa kubama imwenyegho baye, ila kwaapfila tsakakala mtambika mkulu mna ghumwaka aghula, katabili kama Yesu katsakufa kwaajili ya litaifa alyo, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />wala si kwaajili ya litaifa alyo liliyeka baye, ila pfipfila kuwaghala hanu hamwe iwana wa Imlungu iwapwililike wawe wamwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Apfo kulawa litsuwa alila iwakulu wa Wayahudi weka mipango ya kumkoma. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Apfo Yesu ng'aghendile mwatsimwatsi baye haghati ha iwanu wa Yudeya, ila kalawa ako kaghenda habehi na kunyika, kuna ichijiji ichikemighwe Efuraimu, kakala kuko na wanafunzi wake.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ichihungo cha pasaka ya Wayahudi hachipfikile habehi, wanu wengi wagheluka Yerusalemu ili wadeghesighwe ng'ana Ipasaka ipfike. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Wang'ali wombama Yesu, na hawemile mna lihekalu wang'ali weghutsa, “Mkwonatse? Apfi ng'atsakutsa baye kuna lchihungo?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Lekeni iwatambika wakulu na Mafarisayo walapfa laghitso munu wowose iyomanya kwayali Yesu, yalonge, ili wamghoghe.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Maria kombakatsa Yesu ghamapfuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Malk 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Matsuwa sita ng'ana ichihungo cha pasaka chipfike, Yesu kaghenda Betaniya, ukaye kwa Lazaro, imunu ayula Yesu iyamtsihilule kulawa mna lifwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Ako wamtandila Yesu ichijo cha nemihe, na Marita yang'ali yowasang'anila. Lazaro tsakakala yumwe wa iwanu iwang'ali wakuja na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Kuya Mariya kasola isupa ya ghamapfuta gha bei ng'ulu ighonung'ila ghoya, ighalawile mna ghummeya ighukemighwa narido, kambakatsa Yesu ghamaghulu na kumbaghusa kwa tsimvili tsake. Baho ing'anda yose inung'ila ghoya, fumu ghendo! <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Yuda Isikarioti, yumwe wa iwanafunzi wake, ayula hambele iyatsombiduka, kaghutsa, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Heule ghamapfuta aghano ng'aghautsighwe kwa dinari miya ndatu na tsisendi atso weng'ighwe iwahingwa?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Lekeni Yuda tsakalonga apfo, si kwa kuwonela libatsi iwahingwa baye, ila kwaapfila tsakakala mhitsi; pfayakalile yuyo iyang'ali yokindagha ghumfuko ghwa ukwikila tsisendi, yang'ali yakwibagha ichikwikighwa amwo.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Naye Yesu kalonga, “Mlekeni! Ibamighwa yagheke kwa ajili ya litsuwa lya ukuandaa ukutsikighwa kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Iwahingwa mwokala nawo mghati mwenu matsuwa ghose, lekeni nene ng'amtsakuwa nani matsuwa ghose baye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwakulu wa iwatambika wobama kumkoma Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Wayahudi wengi wahulika kuwa Yesu kakala ako Betaniya, waghenda ako, ng'awaghendile kumwona Yesu yaliyeka baye, ila pfipfila wakamwone na Lazaro, imunu ayula Yesu iyamtsihilule. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Apfo iwakulu wa iwatambika wabama inzila ya kumkoma Lazaro, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />kwa apfila kwa ajili ya ukutsihiluka kwake Wayahudi wengi wang'ali wowaleka na kumghendela Yesu, na kumtoghola.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakwingila Yerusalemu kwa kudeng'elelighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Malk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Litsuwa liwinzile iwanu wengi iwatsaile kuna Ichihungo cha Ipasaka wahulika kama Yesu yang'atsile Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Apfo wasola maputila gha mibiki ya mitende, waghenda kumbokela, wakemelela, “Hosana! Yuyo imbarikighwa iyakutsa kwa litaghwa lya Imtwatsa, Kabarikighwa Imfalume wa Isiraeli!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu kapata imwana ipunda, kamdina na kejegha mchanya mwake, kama pfayandikighwe mna Ghamaandiko,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Uleke kupfuka, ghwe neghe Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Lola, mfalume wako kakutsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">kadina imwana wa ipunda.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Imbuli aino aho mwanduso wanafunzi wake tsa ng'awaimanyile baye; lekeni Yesu hayatsihiluke na kutunitsighwa, baho hawakumbuke kuwa agho tsaghandikighwa kwa ajili yake, na kuwa iwanu wamtendela pfipfo.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Iwanu iwakalile na Yesu hayamkemile Lazaro kulawa mna likabuli, na kumtsihilula kulawa mna lifwa, walonga aghala ighalawile. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Kwa ajili ya alyo pfipfila, wanu wengi waghenda kumbokela, kwaapfila wahulika ghumuwujitsa agwo ghwayatendile. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Apfo lelo Mafarisayo welongela, “Mwakona? Ng'atudaha kutenda chinu chochose baye. Iwanu wa isi yose womuwinza!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagiriki wobama ukumwona Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Mna iwanu iwaghendile Yerusalemu mna ichihungo cha Ipasaka wamwenga tsa Wagiriki. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Awo wamghendela Filipi, iyalawile Betisaida mna isi ya Galilaya, wamlongela, “Mkulu, twetwe twobama tumwone Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipi kaghenda, kamlongela Andeleya, kuya wose weli, Filipi na Andeleya, waghenda kumlongela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu kawedika, “Ichipindi chipfika cha ukutunyighwa kwake Imwana wa Adamu! <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Nowalongela kweli ghendo, ka imbeghu ya ingano ng'ailaghala mdongo na ukufa, yokalagha pfipfo imwe iliyeka. Lekeni ing'afa, itsakweleka mbeghu bwelele. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Imunu iyoukunda ugima wake katsowaghitsa, ila imunu iyowihila ugima wake mna iduniya aino, katsoutenda ugima wake ukale matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Munu wowose yang'anitumikila kobamighwa yaniwinze; hanu hanikala nene baho na imtumighwa wangu hayatsokala. Imunu yang'anitumikila, Aba wangu katsomheshimu.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli tsa lifwa lyake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Sambi ghumoyo ghwangu ghughanzika ghendo, nene nonge choni lelo? ‘Baba unikombole na isaa aino?’ Baye, acho chicho chanitsile, nibitile isaa aino ya ghamaghayo. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Baba, ulitunye litaghwa lyako!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Baho litsa litsi kulawa kulanga lilonga, “Nilitunya, na nitsolitunya keli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Likingili lya iwanu iwemile ahala wahulika litsi alyo, na walonga, “Mlungu kaduma”, na wanu wangi walonga, “Malaika kalonga naye!”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Lekeni Yesu kawalongela, “Litsi alino ng'alinitsile nene baye, ila liwatsilani mwemwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Lelo ichipindi cha ukuhighighwa isi aino chipfika, lelo imkulu wa isi aino katsakwasighwa kunze. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Lekeni nene, hanitsakwinulighwa muisi, nitsowakwegha iwanu wose watse kuna nene.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Alyo kalilonga kulangusa lifwa liyatsakufa pfalitsakuwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Mtingano ghwa iwanu wamghutsa, “Ghamalaghitso ghetu ghotulongela Kiristu katsokala ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa, heule lelo ulonga ‘Imwana wa Adamu kobamighwa yenulighwe?’ Apfi ayo Imwana wa Adamu nani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Ghumwanga ghung'ali na mwemwe kwa chipindi chidodo. Mwange hamng'ali naghwo ghumwanga, ng'ana ichisi chiwatsile; mana imunu iyakwanga mchisi ng'omanya baye kuyoghenda. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Hamng'ali naghwo ghumwanga, mghutoghole ghumwanga aghwo, ili muwe wana wa ghumwanga.” Hayamalitse kulonga apfi, Yesu koka, kepfisa waleke kumwona.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wolema ukumtoghola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Hata ka Yesu tsakasang'ana miujitsa mingi yose ayo hambele hawo, lekeni ng'awamtoghole baye. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Aghano ghose ghalawila ili ghatimile aghala ghayalongile Nabii Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Ghwe Mtwatsa, nani iyautoghole usenga wetu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Na ghumoko ghwa Imtwatsa ghughubulighwe kwa nani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Acho chicho ichiwatendile waleke ukutoghola; kwaapfila Isaya pfipfila tsakalonga hanu hangi,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Kawabopfula tsinenge tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">na kaitenda imimoyo yawo iwe mikomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">waleke ukwona kwa tsinenge tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">wala ukumanya kwa imimoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">hela watsonihundukila nene niwahonye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Agho Isaya kaghalonga kwaapfila tsakawona utunitso wa Yesu, na kalonga mbuli tsake.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Hata apfo, wengi mna iwakulu wa Wayahudi tsawamtoghola Yesu, lekeni kwa ajili ya Mafarisayo, ng'awadahile kulonga mwatsimwatsi baye, wang'ali wopfuka watsowawinga mna ghamasinagogi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Kwaapfila tsawanoghelighwa ng'ani na ukuheshimighwa na iwanu kubita ukuheshimighwa na Imlungu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilonga lya Yesu litsohigha iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesu kakemelela kalonga, “Imunu wowose iyonitoghola nene, ng'onitoghola nene baye, ila komtoghola ayula iyanitumile. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Na ayula iyombona nene komwona ayula iyanitumile. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Nene nitsa muisi niwe ghumwanga ghwa iwanu, ili chila munu iyonitoghola nene yaleke kukala mchisi. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Na imunu yang'ahulika ghamalonga ghangu na kulema kughakinda, nene simhigha baye, kwaapfila sitsile kuwahigha iwanu wa isi baye, lekeni nitsa kuwakombola. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Yeye iyonilema nene na kulema imbuli yangu, ayo kenaye iyatsomhigha. Imbuli yiyo yanilongile itsomhigha mna litsuwa lya utsighilo. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Kwaapfila silonga tsimbuli tsangu nimwenyegho baye, ila Aba wangu iyanitumile kandaghitsa cha ukulonga, na nilongetse. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Nomanya laghitso lyake lyoghala ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa, apfo chila chanilonga, kama Baba pfayanilongele pfipfo pfanilonga.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowanawisha ghamaghulu wanafunzi wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Tsa ichihungo cha Pasaka ng'ana chipfike baye, Yesu kamanya saa yake ya ukuka kulawa isi aino na kughenda kwa Aba wake ipfika, naye tsakawakunda ng'ani iwanu wake iwali muisi, na kawakunda pfikomkom ghendo. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Hawang'ali wakuja ichijo cha nemihe, Ibilisi, kamwingila Yuda, imwana wa Simoni Isikarioti mna ghumoyo ghwake, yambiduke Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu kamanya kama Aba keka ukulu wose mna ghamoko ghake, na ka kalawila kwa Imlungu na kakuya kwa Imlungu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Apfo kenuka hana ichijo, keka hambali ghamagwanda ghake, kasola tambala keyoha mchuno. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Kuya kaghela matsi mna libeseni, kandusa kuwanawisha ghamaghulu wanafunzi wake, na kuwabaghusa kwa litambala lyayeyohile mchuno.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Hayapfikile kwa Simoni Petiri, ayo kamghutsa, “Ghwemtwatsa, ghweghwe ghendo uninawishe ghamaghulu nene?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu kamwidika'kalonga, “Chanitenda, sambi ghweghwe ng'uchimanya baye, lekeni kutsochimanya hambele.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petiri kalonga, “Mbe, ng'utsoninawisha baye ghendo ghamaghulu ghangu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesu kamwidika, “Ana sikunawishe ng'utsakuwa na undughu na nene baye.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Baho Simoni Petiri kamwidika, “Ghwemtwatsa, ana ni pfipfo, uleke kuninawisha ghamaghulu ghangu ghaliyeka, ila uninawishe hamwe na ghamoko ghangu na litwi lyangu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu kedika, “Imunu yoghile kobamighwa yanawe ghamaghulu ghaliyeka, kwa apfila ayo kela ilukuli lwose. Mwemwe mwela, ila si wose baye.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Kalonga apfo, “Si mwemwe wose imwelile baye”, kwaapfila tsakamanya munu wachi iyoghenda kumbiduka hambele.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Hayamalitse ukuwanawisha ghamaghulu ghawo, kapfala keli ghamagwanda ghake, kakala hanu hake, kawaghutsa, “Apfi, mghamanya agho ghaniwatendele?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />“Mwonikema nene “Mlangulitsi” na “Imtwatsa”, mwotenda ghoya, kwaapfila apfo pfipfo pfanili. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Lelo, kama nene yanili Imtwatsa na Mlangulitsi, niwanawisha mwemwe ghamaghulu, namwe mwobamighwa pfipfila mwinawishe ghamaghulu, chila munu yamnawishe miyaghe. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Nimlangusani ichinu cha ukutenda, namwe mtende pfipfo pfaniwatendele mwemwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Nowalongelani kweli ghendo, imtumwa si mkulu kubita imtwatsa wake, wala imsenga si mkulu kubita ayula iyamtumile. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Lelo kwa apfila mwopfimanya ipfinu apfino, mtsobweda ka mwopfitenda.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Siwalonga mwemwe wose baye, nowamanya awala yaniwasaghule. Lekeni leka Ghamaandiko ighelile ghatimile, igholonga, ‘Imunu yanikuja naye ichijo kanyinulila ichisegheyu chake.’<verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />“Nowalongela aghano sambi ng'ana ghalawile, ili haghatsolawila mdahe ukutoghola ka ‘Nene nayuyo.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Nowalongelani kweli ghendo, wowose iyombokela imunu yanimtuma konibokela nene, na wowose iyonibokela nene kombokela ayula iyanitumile.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotabili imunu iyatsombiduka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Malk 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu hayamalitse ukulonga apfo, kaghanzika ng'ani mna iloho yake, kalonga, “Nowalongela kweli ghendo, yumwe mna mwemwe katsonibiduka!”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Wanafunzi wake welolesa, lekeni ng'awamanyile baye yang'ali yomlonga nani. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Mwanafunzi yumwe, iyakundeighwe na Yesu, tsakakala habehi naye. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Petiri kampfinyighitsa na kulonga, “Mghutse, yomlonga nani.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Baho imwanafunzi ayo kaseghela habehi ghendo na Yesu, kamghutsa, “Gwemtwatsa, umlonga nani?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu kamwidika, “Imunu ayula yanimwing'a ichihande cha ichighate chanitsunika mwibakuli, ayo yuyo.” Kuya kasola ichihande cha ichighate, katsunika, kamwing'a Yuda, imwana wa Simoni Iskarioti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Bahala Yuda hayabokele ichihande cha ichighate, Setani kamwingila. Kuya Yesu kamlongela, “Chaubama kutenda, tenda himahima, uleke kukawa!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Lekeni mna awala iwang'ali wakuja ichijo hamwe naye, haduhu hata mnu yumwe iyamanyile hebali Yesu tsayamlongele apfo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kwaapfila Yuda tsakakala mkindamkoba ghwa isendi, wangi wapfikitsa Yesu kamlongela yaghende kughula ipfinu ipfibamighwa mna Ichihungo, au ukuweng'a chinu iwahingwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Bahala Yuda hayabokele ichihande cha ichighate, kalawa kunze. Tsaikala nechilo.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laghitso lya sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuda hayokile, Yesu kalonga, “Lelo katunyighwa Imwana wa Adamu, na mghati mwake Imlungu naye katunyighwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Ka Imlungu katunyighwa mghati mwa Imwana, Imlungu naye katsomtunya Imwana mghati mwake imwenyegho, na katsomtunya hima ghendo. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Wanangu, ning'ali namwe kwa chipindi chidodo. Mtsonibama, lekeni kama pfaniwalongele Wayahudi, nowalongela na mwemwe, ‘Kwanighenda ng'amdaha kutsa baye.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Lelo noweng'a laghitso lya sambi, Mwikunde. Ka pfaniwakundile nene, namwe mwikunde pfipfo. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Mng'atenda apfo, iwanu wose watsomanya ka mwemwe mwa wanafunzi wangu, hamwitsekunda mwemwe kwa mwemwe.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotabili Petiri pfayatsomhunduka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Malk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petiri kamghutsa, “Ghwemtwatsa, ughenda kwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesu kamwidika, “Kwanighenda ng'udaha baye sambi kuniwinza, lekeni kutsoniwinza hambele.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petiri kamghutsa, “Ghwemtwatsa, heule sidaha kukuwinza sambi? Nene hata ugima wangu nitsoulapfa kwa ajili yako!”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kodaha kundapfila nene ugima wako? Nokulongela kweli ghendo, ng'ana ijogholo yeke, ghweghwe kutsonibela mala ndatu!<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu yuyo inzila ya ukughenda kwa Baba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Mleke kughanzika mna imimoyo yenu, mwomtoghola Imlungu, pfipfila mnitoghole na nene. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Mng'anda mwa Aba wangu mna pfiheleto pfingi, ing'awile si pfipfo baye ning'awalongele, mana noghenda kuwaandalila hanu henu. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Na ning'aghenda, na kuwaandalila hanu henu, nitsowoyila nimsoleni, ili ahala hanikala nene, na mwemwe mkale baho. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Na akula kwanighenda, inzila mwemwe mwuimanya.” <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi kamghutsa, “Ghwemtwatsa, twetwe ng'atumanyile baye kwani kwaughenda, lelo inzila tuimanyatse?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu kamwidika, “Nene na inzila, na ukweli, na ugima. Haduhu munu iyodaha kughenda kwa Baba bila kubitila kuna nene. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Tsamng'animanyile nene, pfipfila mng'ammanyile Aba wangu; na kulawa sambi mwommanya na mmwona.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipi kamlongela, “Ghwemtwatsa, utulanguse Baba, acho chicho chatumbama.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu kamlongela, “Filipi, nene nikala namwe matsuwa mengi, ghweghwe ung'ali ng'una unimanye baye? Imunu wowose iyambonile nene kamwona Baba. Lelo hebari ghweghwe ulonga, 'Tulanguse Baba?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Apfi ghweghwe ng'utoghola baye ka nene namghati mwa Baba, naye Baba kamghati mwangu? Tsimbuli tsanilonga si tsangu baye,” ila Baba iyokala mghati mwangu kosang'ana tsing'onde tsake. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Mnitoghole haniwalongela nene namghati mwa Baba naye Baba kamghati mwangu. Ana ng'amlitoghola alyo, togholani kwa ajili ya tsisang'ano tsenyegho. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Nowalongela kweli ghendo, imunu iyonitoghola nene tsisang'ano tsanitenda nene, yeye naye katsotsitenda, kuya katsotenda hata pfinu pfikulu kubita apfino, kwaapfila nene noghenda kwa Aba wangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Namwe mng'alomba chochose kwa litaghwa lyangu nitsowatendelani, ili Aba yatunitsighwe kubitila Imwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Hamtsonilomba chinu chochose kwa litaghwa lyangu, nene nitsowatendelani.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga katsowaghalila Iloho Yelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Mwemwe mng'anikunda, mtsoghakinda ghamalaghitso ghangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Na nene nitsomlomba Aba, naye katsomwing'ani Mwapfila yungi, iyatsokala namwe ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Ayo Iloho wa kweli, ayula iwanu wa isi ng'awodaha baye ukumbokela kwaapfila ng'awomwona baye, wala ng'awomtanga baye. Lekeni mwemwe mwomtanga, kwaapfila kokala namwe, naye katsakuwa mghati mwenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Sitsowaleka mwawachuwa baye, nakutsa kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Bado chipindi chidodo ichikutsa iwanu wa isi ng'awatsombona keli baye, lekeni mwemwe mtsombona; kwaapfila nene nokala mgima, pfipfila namwe mtsokala wagima. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Mna litsuwa alyo mtsomanya nene namghati mwa Aba wangu, namwe mwamghati mwangu, na nene namghati mwenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />“Imunu ayula iyobokela ghamalaghitso ghangu na kughatenda, ayo yuyo iyonikunda. Naye iyonikunda nene Aba wangu katsomkunda, pfipfila na nene nitsomkunda na nitsebonesa kuna yeye.” <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda, si Yuda Iskarioti baye, kaghutsa, “Ghwemtwatsa, hebali ubama kwibonesa kuna twetwe tuliyeka na si kwa iwanu wa isi yose baye?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu kamwidika, “Imunu yang'anikunda nene katsoghatenda ghamalangulitso ghangu, na Aba wangu katsomkunda; kuya nene na Aba wangu tutsomtsila na kukala naye. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Munu wowose ing'ayonikunda nene ng'oghatenda baye ghamalangulitso ghangu; na ghamalangulitso ghamhulika si ghangu baye, ila gholawa kwa Aba iyanitumile.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Aghano nimlongelani haning'ali nikala namwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Lekeni ayo Imshauri, Iloho Yelile, Baba iyatsomghala kwa litaghwa lyangu, katsowalangulitsa mmanye ipfinu pfose, na kuwatenda mkumbuke chila chinu chaniwalongele.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Nowalekela amani, amani yangu noweng'a; na nene siweng'a kama isi pfaitendagha baye. Mleke kughanzika mmoyo mwenu, wala mleke kuwa na wogha. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Tsamhulika haniwalongele, ‘Nakuka, kuya nitsowatsila.’ Tsamng'anikundile mng'adeng'elele nene ukughenda kwa Baba, kwaapfila Baba mkulu kubita nene. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Lelo niwalongela ng'ana ghalawile, ili haghatsolawila mdahe ukutoghola. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Nene sitsolonga keli namwe mbuli nyingi baye, kwaapfila imkulu wa iisi aino kakutsa, naye kahela chinu kuna nene, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Lekeni iwanu wa isi wamanye ka nene nomkunda Baba, na kama apfila Aba wangu pfayanilaghitse pfipfo pfanitenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">Haya, mwinuke tukeni.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu yuyo ghumtsabibu ghwa kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Nene naghumtsabibu ghwa kweli, na Aba wangu yuyo imkulima. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Chila putila ing'alikweleka matunda, koligana, na chila putila ilikweleka ghamatunda, kolisangulila ili lyeleke ng'ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Mwemwe mala mwela kwa imbuli aila yanimlongeleni. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Kaleni mghati mwangu, kama nene pfanikala mghati mwenu. Kama apfila haduhu putila ilidaha kweleka lyenyegho, bila kukala mna ghumtsabibu, fipfila namwe ng'amdpaha baye kweleka ghamatunda bila kukala mghati mwangu.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Nene na ghumtsabibu, mwemwe mwaghamaputila. Munu iyokala mghati mwangu na nene nikale mghati mwake, ayo katsakweleka matunda mengi ng'ani; kwaapfila bila nene mwemwe mliyeka ng'amdaha kutenda chinu chochose baye. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Mnu wowose yang'okala mghati mwangu, kakwasighwa kunze kulonga putila, na lyonyala. Ghamaputila agho ghokungighwa na iwanu, ghakwasighwa mmoto, gholakatsighwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Mng'akala mghati mwangu, na usenga wangu ung'akala mghati mwenu, mlombe chinu chochose chambama, namwe mtsokwing'ighwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Apfo Aba wangu kotunyighwa kwa apfila mwakweleka matunda mengi, namwe mtsakuwa ghendo wanafunzi wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Kama apfila Aba pfaayanikundile nene, pfipfo na nene pfaniwakundile mwemwe, apfo lelo mkale mna ukukundighwa ako na nene. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Mng'aghakinda ghamalaghitso ghangu, mtsokala mna ukukundighwa na nene, kama apfila nene pfanighakindile ghamalaghitso gha Aba wangu na kukala mna ukukundighwa na yeye.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Aghano nimlongelani ili indeng'elelo yangu ikale mghati mwenu, na indeng'elelo yenu iwe ng'ulu. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Alino lilyo lilaghitso lyangu, mwikunde kama apfila nene pfaniwakundile mwemwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Kuduhu munu yaana upendo mkulu kubita auno, wa imunu kuulapfa ugima wake kwaajili ya mbwigha tsake. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Mwemwe mwa mbwigha tsangu mng'atenda aghala ghaniwalaghitsa. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Siwakema keli mwemwe watumwa baye, kwaapfila imtumwa ng'omanya baye chayotenda imtwatsa wake. Lekeni mwemwe nowakema mbwigha tsangu, kwaapfila ghose ghanihulike kwa Aba wangu nimlongelani. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Si mwemwe baye yamnisaghule, ila nene yanimsaghuleni, na niweka mghende mkeleke matunda, na ghamatunda ghenu ghaleke kuhupa; ili cho chose chamumlomba Baba kwa litaghwa lyangu yamwing'eni. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Lelo nomlaghitsani, Mwikunde.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi yowehila Iwanafunzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Iwanu wa isi wang'awehilani, mmanye kuwa tsawalongola kunyihila nene. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Tsamng'awile wanu wa isi aino, iwanu wa isi wang'amkundileni kama iwanu wake. Lekeni kwaapfila mwemwe si wa isi aino baye, ila nene nimsaghulani mghati mwa iwanu wa isi aino. Kwaajili ayo iwanu wa isi womwihilani. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Mkumbuke chaniwalongele, ‘Imtumwa si mkulu kubita imtwatsa wake baye.’ Kama wanidununza nene, namwe pfipfila watsomdununzani. Wang'aghakinda ghamalangulitso ghangu, pfipfila watsoghakinda ghamalangulitso ghenu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Watsowatendela aghano ghose kwaajili ya litaghwa lyangu, kwaapfila ng'awammanyile baye ayula iyanitumile. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Tsakama sitsile na kulonga nawo, ng'awabamie kuwa na nzambi baye, lekeni sambi ng'awodaha kwiyamila baye kwa inzambi yawo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Imunu iyonyihila nene, pfipfila komwihila na Aba wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Tsa ana sitendile sang'ano kuna wawo ng'ana tsitendighwe na munu yungi, ng'awabamile kuwa na nzambi baye. Lekeni sambi watwona, nene na Aba wangu, na watwihila wose. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Lekeni ilawila apfino kutimitsa imbuli iyandikighwe mna Ghamalaghitso ghawo: ‘Wanyihila hela.’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Lekeni hayatsakutsa Imwapfitsi, ayula yanitsomghalilani kulawa kwa Baba, ayo Iloho wa kweli iyolawa kwa Baba, yeye katsakuwa mkalangama wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Pfipfila namwe mwawakalangama wangu, kwaapfila mkala na nene kulawa mwanduso.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Yesu kaghendelela kulonga, “Niwalongela aghano ghose ili mleke ukumlema Imlungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Mtsowingighwa mna ghamasinagogi; na ichipindi chakutsa chila mnu iyatsowakoma katsofikitsa komlapfila nambiko Imlungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Na iwanu watsomtendelani aghano kwaapfila ng'awammanyile Baba wala nene. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Lekeni nimlongelani aghano, ili ichipindi acho hachitsakutsa mkumbuke kuwa tsaniwalongela.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Ing'onde ya Iloho Yelile</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Siwalongele aghano kulawa mwanduso kwaapfila tsanahamwe namwe.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />“Lekeni sambi nene noghenda kwa ayula iyanitumile, na haduhu munu iyonighutsa, ‘Ughenda kwani?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Ila kwaapfila niwalongela aghano, imimoyo yenu imema ihutsuni. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Lekeni nowalongela kweli ghendo, pfinogha kuna mwemwe nene mbuke, kwaapfila kama sikuka baye, Imwapfitsi ng'atsomtsilani baye. Lekeni ning'oka, ayo nitsomghalilani. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Naye hayatsakutsa, katsohindaghitsa kuna imimoyo ya iwanu wa isi kwa tsimbuli tsa inzambi, na tsimbuli tsa ukutenda ihaki, na tsimbuli tsa ukuhigha kwa Imlungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Mna tsimbuli tsa inzambi, kwaapfila ng'awonitoghola nene baye; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Mna tsimbuli tsa ihaki, kwaapfila nene noghenda kwa Baba, wala ng'ammbona keli baye, <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />na mna tsimbuli tsa ukuhigha, kwaapfila imkulu wa isi aino mala kahighighwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Hata sambi ning'ali na mbuli nyingi tsa kumlongelani, lekeni ng'amdaha kutsidudumila baye. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Lekeni hayatsakutsa Iloho wa kweli, yeye katsowalongotsa muumanye ukweli wose; kwa apfila ng'atsolonga ighali ghake imwenyegho baye, ila katsolonga aghala ghayohulika; na aghala ighakutsa nagho katsowalongela. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Yeye katsonitunya nene, kwaapfila katsosola mna ighali ghangu na kuwalongela mwemwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Ghose ghayali nagho Baba ghakwangu. Acho chicho ichinitendile niwalongele, ' katsosola mna ighali ghangu na kuwalongela mwemwe'.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hutsuni na Ndeng'elelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Ching'ali chipindi chidodo ng'amtsombona baye, kuya chipindi chidodo keli hambele mtsombona.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Wangi mna iwanafunzi wake weghutsa, “Angu mbuli yachi aino iyolonga, “Ching'ali chipindi chidodo ng'amtsombona baye, kuya chipindi chidodo keli hambele mtsombona?” Na lingi, ‘Kwaapfila noghenda kwa Baba?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Waghendelela kwighutsa, “Mana yake choni hayolonga, 'Ching'ali chipindi chidodo’? Ng'atumanya baye yolonga mbuli yachi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu kamanya kuwa wabama kumghutsa, apfo kawalongela, “Pfihi mweghutsa tsamana yangu choni hanilongile, ‘Ching'ali chipindi chidodo ng'amtsombona keli, kuya chipindi chidodo keli hambele mtsombona’? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Nowalongela kweli ghendo, mwemwe mtsolila na kudomboketsa, lekeni isi itsodeng'elela. Mwemwe mtsohutsunika, lekeni ihutsuni yenu itsoghaluka kuwa ndeng'elelo. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Ipinga hayakweleka, kana hutsuni kwaapfila ichipindi chake cha ukudununzika chipfika, lekeni imwana yang'oneka, ng'okumbuka keli baye akula ukudununzika, kwa ajili ya indeng'elelo iyali nayo kwaapfila mwana koneka muisi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Na mwemwe pfipfila, sambi apfino mna hutsuni, lekeni nitsomwonani keli, namwe mtsodeng'elela, na indeng'elelo yenu kuduhu imunu iyodaha kuwaboka.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />“Na mna litsuwa alyo ng'amtsonilomba chinu chochose baye. Nowalongela ghendo, chinu chochose chamumlomba Baba katsomwing'ani kwa litaghwa lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mbaka sambi ng'amna mlombe chinu chochose baye kwa litaghwa lyangu. Lelo mlombe, namwe mtsobokela, ili indeng'elo yenu iwe ng'ulu ghendo.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kaihuma isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Aghano nimlongelani kwa mitsungu, lekeni ichipindi chakutsa sitsolonga namwe kwa mitsungu baye, ila nitsolonga namwe mwatsimwatsi tsimbuli tsa Aba wangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Mna litsuwa alyo mtsolomba kwa litaghwa lyangu, wala siwalongela kuwa nene nitsowalombela kwa Baba; <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />mana Baba imwenyegho komkundani, kwaapfila mwemwe mnikunda nene na mtoghola kuwa nilawa kwa Imlungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Nilawa kwa Baba, nitsa muisi; kuya noileka isi, nakuya kwa Baba.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Kuya iwanafunzi wake walonga, “Afatsali, sambi lelo kolonga mwatsimwatsi, bila mitsungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Lelo twomanya kama ghweghwe kwomanya ghose, wala ng'ubama mbaka munu yakughutse baye. Ichinu achino chotutenda tutoghole kama ghweghwe kulawa kwa Imlungu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu kawedika, “Pfihi sambi mwotoghola?” <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Mlole, chipindi chakutsa, na tiyari chipfika, mwemwe wose mtsopwililika, chila munu kakuka ukaye yake, na nene mtsonileka niliyeka. Lekeni siliyeka baye, kwaapfila Baba kahamwe na nene. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />“Nimlongelani aghano ili mkale tseghamba mghati mwangu. Muisi aino mtsodununzika; lekeni mwighangamitse, nene niihuma isi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalombela iwanafunzi wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu hayamalitse ukulonga agho, kenula tsinenge kalola kulanga, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 17:1">“Baba, ichipindi chipfika. Watende iwanu wawone utunitso wa Imwanagho, ili na Imwanagho yawatende iwanu wawone utunitso wako. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Kwaapfila kumwing'a Imwanagho ukulu kwa iwanu wose, ili yaweng'e ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa awala wose waumwing'ile. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Auno wuwo ugima wa ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa, iwanu wakumanye ghweghwe Imlungu uliyeka wa kweli, na wammanye Yesu Kiristu yaumtumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Nene nikutunitsa ghweghwe muisi kwa kuimalitsa ing'onde yaungaile niisang'ane. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Lelo, Baba, unitunitse nene hamwe naghwe, kwa utunitso aula wanikalile nawo hamwe naghwe ahala ng'ana isi iumbighwe.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Nikutenda umanyike kwa iwanu awala waungayile muisi. Tsawakala wako, naghwe kungaya nene, nawo waghakinda ghamalangulitso ghako. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Sambi wamanya ipfinu pfose pfaungayile pfolawa kuna ghweghwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Kwaapfila usenga waungayile niweng'a, nawo waubokela, na wamanya ghendo kuwa nene ndawa kuna ghweghwe, na watoghola kama ghweghwe kunituma.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Nene nowalombela wawo. Siwalombela iwanu wa isi baye, ila nowalombela iwanu awala waungayile, kwaapfila awo wako. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Na wose iwali wangu pfipfila wako, na iwali wako pfipfila wangu; na nene nitunitsighwa mghati mwawo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Wala nene sing'ali muisi keli baye, lekeni wawo wang'ali muisi, na nene nakutsa kuna ghweghwe. Ghwe Baba yuwelile! Wakinge kwa tsingupfu tsa litaghwa lyako lyaungayile, ili wawe wamwe kama ghweghwe na nene pfatuli wamwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Haning'ali nikala nawo, niwalolesa kwa tsingupfu tsa litaghwa lyako lyaungayile. Niwakinga, wala haduhu munu iyaghile, ila ayula iyandikighwe ukwagha, ili Ghamaandiko ghatimile. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />“Lelo sambi nakutsa kuna ghweghwe, na aghano noghalonga haning'ali muisi, ili wameme indeng'elo yangu mna imimoyo yawo. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Niweng'a ghamalangulitso ghako na iwanu wa isi wawehila, kwaapfila wawo si wa isi aino baye, kama nene pfanili si wa isi aino baye. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nene sikulomba uwalapfe muisi baye, ila nokulomba uwakinge na ayula Yehile. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Wawo si wa isi aino baye, kama apfila nene pfanili si wa isi aino. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Uwatende wele kwa aula ukweli; ghamalangulitso ghako ghagho ukweli. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Kama apfila ghweghwe pfaunitumile muisi, na nene pfipfo niwatuma muisi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Lelo kwaajili yawo nelapfa nimwenyegho kuna ghweghwe, ili wawo nawo welapfe ghendo kuna ukweli.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Si wawo waliyeka baye waniwalombela, ila pfipfila nowalombela na awala iwatsonitoghola nene kwa usenga wawo. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Wose wawe wamwe; kama ghweghwe Baba, pfauli mghati mwangu, na nene mghati mwako; na wawo wawe mghati mwetu,, ili iwanu wa isi watoghole kuwa ghweghwe kunituma. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Iheshima aila yaungaile nene, na nene niweng'a wawo, ili wawe wamwe kama twetwe pfatuli wamwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Nene mghati mwawo, naghwe mghati mwangu, ili wawe wamwe ghendo ghendo. Aho iwanu wa isi watsomanya kuwa ghweghwe kunituma, na kuwa kuwakunda wawo kama pfaunikundile nene.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Baba, awala waungayile nobama wawe hamwe na nene hanu hanili, ili wayone iheshima yangu yaungayile; kwaapfila tsakunikunda ng'ana imisingi ya isi ikighwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Baba yuna ihaki, iwanu wa isi ng'awakumanyile baye, lekeni nene nikumanya; na awano womanya kuwa kunituma. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nikutenda wakumanye, na nitsoghendelela kukutenda wakumanye, ili ukukunda akula kwaunikundie nene kuwe mghati mwawo, na nene niwe mghati mwawo.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu koghoghighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Malk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu hayamalitse ukulomba, yeye na iwanafunzi wake waloka kumwambu mwa ilwanda lwa Kidironi; na hanu aho tsahana bostani, wengila amwo yeye na iwanafunzi wake. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Naye Yuda, iyabamile ujkumhunduka Yesu, tsakahamanya hanu ahala, kwaapfila Yesu tsakaghendagha baho na iwanafunzi wake. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Apfo Yuda kaghenda kuna ibostani ayo, hamwe na chikosi cha asikali, na watumishi iwatumighwe na iwatambika wakulu na Mafarisayo. Watsa na pfitasa, pfiwenge na silaha. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu aku kamanya ghose ighatsomlawila, kawaghendela kawaghutsa, “Mumbama nani?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Wamwidika, “Yesu wa Nazareti,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesu kawalongela, “Yuyo nene.” Naye Yuda iyamhunduke tsakakala kema baho hamwe nawo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesu hayawalongele, “Yuyo nene,” woya kuchughu waghwa hasi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Baho Yesu kawaghutsa keli, “Mumbama nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Wamwidika, “Yesu wa Nazareti.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu kawalongela, “Ambe niwalongela yuyo nene! Lelo kama mwonibama nene, walekeni awano woke.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Kalonga apfo ili tsaaghala ghayalongile ghatimile, “Baba iwanu awala waungayile simwaghitse hata yumwe baye.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Baho Simoni Petiri, tsakakala na panga, kalisomola, kamsepula lighutwi lya kujilo imtumwa wa Imtambika mkulu. Imtumwa ayo tsakakemighwa Malikus. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Baho Yesu kamlaghitsa Petiri, “Wuyitsa lipanga mna iyala yake, pfihi ichikombe cha ghamaghayo chayangayile Baba nileke kuchinwela?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa kwa Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Baho awala wamaasikali, na mkulu wawo, na iwatumishi wa Wayahudi wamghogha Yesu, wamwoha, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />tanu wamghala kwa Anasi, mana Anasi tsakakala baba mkwe yake Kayafa, iyakalile mtambika mkulu ghumwaka aghula. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Naye Kayafa yuyo ayula iyawalongele iwakulu wa Wayahudi kuwa ng'apfu munu yumwe yafe kwaajili ya ukuhona kwa iwanu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Malk 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petiri na mwanafunzi yungi wamuwinza Yesu. Na imwanafunzi ayula tsakamanyika na Imtambika mkulu, apfo kengila hamwe na Yesu kuna ichikuta cha Imtambika mkulu, <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />lekeni Petiri kema kunze mwa lilango. Baho imwanafunzi ayula yungi iyamanyike na Imtambika mkulu kalawa, kalonga na imbetetsi wa lilango, kamwingitsa Petiri mng'anda. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Ipinga iyobetetsa lilango kamghutsa Petiri, “Apfi naghwe ng'uli yumwe baye wa iwanafunzi wake imunu ayuno?” Naye kalonga, “Aka! Baye ghendo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Kwaapfila tsakukala na chipfeghetsi, iwatumwa na iwabetetsi wabwina ghumoto, wang'ali wakota. Naye Petiri kema hamwe nawo, kakota ghumoto.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imtambika mkulu komghutsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Malk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Imtambika mkulu kamghutsa Yesu tsimbuli tsa iwanafunzi wake na tsimbuli tsa ghamalangulitso ghake. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu kamwidika, “Nilonga mwatsimwatsi na iwanu wose; ghamatsuwa ghose nilangulitsa mna ghamasinagogi na mna lihekalu, hawetinganila hamwe Wayahudi wose. Silongile chinu chochose kwa chipfiso baye. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Heule unighutsa nene? Waghutse awala iwahulike chaniwalongele, wawo womanya chanilongile choni.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Baho hayalongile agho, mbetetsi yumwe iyemile habehi kamtsaba kofi Yesu kalonga, “Heule umwidika apfo Imtambika mkulu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu kamwidika, “Ana nilongile chinu chihile, uchilonge hambele ha iwanu. Lekeni kama nilonga ghoya, unitowela choni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Kuya Anasi kamghala aku kohighwa kwa Kayafa, Imtambika mkulu.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kombela keli Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Malk 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simoni Petiri tsayang'ali kema kuko kakota ghumoto, iwanu wamghutsa, “Pfihi naghwe ng'uli mwanafunzi wa imunu ayuno baye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Naye kebemenda, kalonga, “Aka! Baye ghendo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Mtumwa yumwe wa Imtambika mkulu, naye tsandughu yake ayula iyasepulighwe lighutwi na Petiri, kamghutsa, “Angu nene sikwonile baye akula kuna ibostani uli hamwe naye?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Petiri kabela keli; na baho ijogholo keka.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Malk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Lupfiripfiri nemitondo wamsola Yesu kulawa kwa Kayafa wamghala kuna ing'anda ya igavana wa Roma, ikemighwe Praitorio. Lekeni wawo iwenyegho ng'awengile baye mng'anda, kwaapfila wapfuka ukwitenda wehe, ili wadahe kuchija ichijo cha Ipasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Pilato kalawa kunze kawaghutsa, “Apfi kunaghomba lyachi lyamumghalile imunu ayuno?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Wamwidika, na kumlongela, “Kama ayuno ng'atendile totso ng'atubamile kukughalila baye.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato kawalongela, “Lelo msoleni mkamhighe kwa aila Itorati yenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Wapfilongotsi wa Wayahudi wamlongela, “Twetwe ng'atuna luhusa ya kukoma munu wowose baye.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Ilawila apfino ili ghatimile aghala ghayalongile Yesu, kulangusa chifo chachi chayatsakufa.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Kuya Pilato kengila keli mng'anda, kamghutsa Yesu, “Apfi ghweghwe kwa mfalume wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu kamghutsa, “Ghwewghwe kolonga aghano kwaghumoyo ghwako ghumwenyegho, au wanu wangi wakulongela mbuli tsangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato kamwidika, “Apfi kwopfikitsa nene na Myahudi? Iwanu wako na iwatambika wakulu wawo iwakughalile kuna nene. Angu utendile choni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu kalonga, “Ufalume wangu si wa isi aino baye; tsaufalume wangu ung'awile wa isi aino, iwatumighwa wangu wang'etowile na Wayahudi waleke kunighogha. Lekeni ufalume wangu si wa hanu ahano baye!”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilato kamghutsa, “Apfi ghweghwe kwa mfaume?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwolonga nene namfalume. Nene nyelekighwa kwa ajili ya aghano, na kwa ajili ya aghano nitsa muisi, ili nitangatse mbuli tsa ukweli. Chila munu iyali wa ukweli awo konitegheletsa chanilonga.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato kamghutsa, “Ukweli ndo choni?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu kohighighwa yakomighwe</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Malk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Kuya hayalongile alyo, kalawa keli kunze kwawali Wayahudi, kawalongela, “Nene sikona totso lyolyose baye lya ukumhigha imunu ayuno. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Lekeni mwemwe mna ichihendo chenu, cha nene kumlekelela mwohighwa yumwe chila hachipfika ichipindi cha Pasaka; lelo pfihi mwobama nimlekeleleni Imfalume wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Baho wakemelela ghendo, walonga, “Baye, si ayuno mbe! Twombama Baraba!" Naye Baraba tsakakala munu mbapfi.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Baho Pilato kamsola Yesu kamfapula kwa mijeledi. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Maasikali wabota taji lya miba walika mwitwi mwake. Kuya wampfatsa gwanda lya chifalume lya nzambalau. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Wang'ali womghendela na kulonga, “Mbukwa, ghwe mfalume wa Wayahudi!” Akuno womtsaba makofi.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato kalawa keli kunze kawalongela, “Mlole, nomlapfa kunze, na mmanye nene sonile totso lyolyose lya kumhigha baye.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Baho Yesu kalawa kunze aku kapfala litaji lya imiba na ligwanda lya chifalume lya nzambalau. Pilato kawalongela, “Mlole! Ayuno ahano.”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Iwakulu wa iwatambika na iwatumishi wawo hawamwonile, wakemelela, walonga “Mkondeke! Mkondeke!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilato kawalongela, “Msoleni, mkamkondeke mwemwe, mana nene sonile totso baye kuna yeye.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Wapfilongotsi wa Wayahudi wamwidika, “Twetwe tuna Sharia, na kwa isharia ayo kobamighwa yafe, kwaapfila ketenda imwenyegho Mwana wa Imlungu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato hayahulike apfo, kongetsa ukupfuka. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Baho kengila keli mng'anda ya uliwali kamghutsa Yesu, “Angu ghweghwe ulawila kwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Lekeni Yesu ng'amwidike baye. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilato kamlongela, “Kolema ukulonga na nene? Ng'umanya baye kama nina uwetso wa kukulekelela au wa kukukondeka mna ghumsalaba?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe ng'ubamile uwe na uwetso wa kunihigha kama ng'wing'ighwe kulawa kuchanya baye uwetso awo. Apfo, ayula iyanighelile mna ghamoko ghako kana nzambi ili ng'ulu ng'ani.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Pilato hayahulike apfi, kabama nzila ya ukumlekelela Yesu. Lekeni Wayahudi wadamilila walonga, “Ung'amlekelela ayuno, ghweghwe ng'uli mbwigha wake Kaisari baye! Chila munu iyetenda imwenyegho mfalume komtendela tsengwe Kaisari!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilato hayahulike apfo, kamlapfa Yesu kunze, kakala mna ichighoda cha ukulamlila ghamaghomba, hanu ihokemighwa “Sakafu ya Ghamabwe”, au kwa Chieburaniya “Gabatha.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Nayo ikala saa sita nemisi, litsuwa lya ukuitanda Ipasaka, naye kawalongela Wayahudi, “Ayuno ahano mfalume wenu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Lekeni Wayahudi wadamilila,walonga, “Mkome! Mkome! Mkondeke kumsalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilato kawaghutsa, “Pfihi nimkondeke kumsalaba imfalume wenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Iwakulu wa iwatambika wamwidika, “Twetwe twahela mfaslume yungi ila Kaisari yaliyeka!”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Baho kamwika mmoko mwawo ili yakondekighwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu kokondekighwa mna ghumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Malk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Nawo wambokela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Naye Yesu kalawa aku koduta ghumsalaba ghwake mbaka hanu hakemighwe 'Bombwe lya Litwi', na kwa Chiheburaniya hokemighwa 'Goligota'. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Baho wamkondeka mna ghumsalaba; hamwe na yeye pfipfila wakondekighwa wanu weli, yumwe ubali auno, na wakeli ubali ungi, Yesu haghatighati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Naye Pilato kandika bango kalibandika mna ghumsalaba, ilyandikighwe, “Yesu Mnazareti, Mfalume wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Libango alyo Wayahudi wengi walisoma, kwaapfila hanu hayakondekighwe Yesu tsahakala habehi na ghumji, na libango alyo lyandikighwa kwa Chiheburaniya, kwa Chilatini na kwa Chigiriki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Iwakulu wa iwatambika na Wayahudi wamlongela Pilato, “Leka kwandika ‘Mfalume wa Wayahudi,’ ila wandike 'Imunu ayula iyelongile yeye mfalume wa Wayahudi'.”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato kawedika kalonga, “Chanyandike, nyandika.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Nawo wamaaskali hawamkondeke Yesu, wasola tsinguo tsake, watsighola mabughulu mane, chila askali bughulu lyake; wasola na likanzu nalyo. Lelo likanzu lyake tsang'alishonighwe baye, ila lifumighwa kwanzila kuchanya mbaka kuhisi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Apfo welongeLa, “Tuleke kulidegha, leka tutowe simbi tulole yuhi yatsolipata.” Ilawila apfino ili litimile liandiko alila ililonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Wegholela tsinguo tsangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">na likanzu lyangu walitowela simbi.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Na apfino pfipfo ghendo pfawatendile wamaaskali awala.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Hana ghumsalaba ghwa Yesu tsawema mamo wake, lumbu wa mamo wake, Mariya mwehe wa Kileopa, na Mariya Magdalena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu hayamwonile mai wake na imwanafunzi ayula iyamkundile kema habehi naye, kamlongela mai wake, “Mamo, ayo aho yuyo imwanagho.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Kuya kamlongela imwanafunzi ayula, “Lola, ayo mai wako.” Kulawa isaa yiyo, imwanafunzi ayula kamsola Mariya, koka naye ukaye yake.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakufa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Malk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Agho haghabitie, Yesu aku kamanya kama ghose ghatimila, ili Ghamaandiko ighelile ghatimile, kalonga, “Nakwona ng'ilu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Hanu ahala tsahakala na siki, apfo wapfabika dodoki mna isiki, walika mna ilubiki lwa mhisopo, wamwikila mumlomo. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu hayanzile siki ayo kalonga, “Ghatimila.” Kenamitsa litwi lyake, kafa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohomighwa mlubapfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Tsalikala Litsuwa lya ukwitanda kwa ajili ya litsuwa lya Isabato ilupfi yake. Tsing'uli gng'atsibamighwe tsisighale mna imisalaba baye mna Litsuwa lya Sabato (mana Litsuwa lya Isabato alila tsalikala tsuwa kulu), wapfilongotsi wa Wayahudi wamlomba Pilato ghamaghulu gha iwanu iwakondekighwe ghabenighwe, kuya imitufi yawo ihulumsighwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Apfo asikali waghenda, waghabena ghamaghulu gha imunu wa mwanduso iyakondekighwe hamwe na Yesu, kuya waghabena ghamaghulu gha ayula yungi. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Lekeni hawapfikile kwa Yesu wampfika mala kafa, apfo ng'awambenile baye ghamaghulu ghake. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Lekeni askali yumwe kamuhoma Yesu mlubapfu kwa mghoha, bahala ilawa idamu na matsi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Imunu iyonile ichilawile katulongela ukalangama, na ukalangama wake wolongesa; kuya yeye komanya kama kolongesa, ili mwemwe namwe mdahe kutoghola. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Ilawila apfino ili liandiko litimile, ililonga, “Haduhu mpate ghwake ighutsobenighwa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Kuya keli andiko lingine lyolonga, “Watsomlola ayula iwamhomile.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotsikighwa kuna imango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Malk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Hambele, Yosefu imunu iyolawila ghumji ghwa Arimataya, kamlomba Pilato yamwing'e ilukuli lwa Yesu (Yosefu tsakakala mwanafunzi wa Yesu kwa chipfiso kwa ajili ya ukuwapfuka iwakulu wa Wayahudi). Pilato kamwing'a luhusa, apfo kaghenda kalusola. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Yosefu tsakelongotsa na Nikodemu, imunu ayula tsaiyaghendile kwa Yesu hachilochilo aho mwanduso, naye Nikodemu kaghala kilo salasini tsa upfumba unung'ila ghoya wa manemane na udi. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Awo walusola ilukuli lwa Yesu, walupfatsa sanda ya chitani, hamwe na aula upfumba iunung'ila ghoya, kama pfachili ichihendo cha Wayahudi cha ukutsika. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Na hanu hayakondekighwe Yesu tsahakala na bostani, na mna ibostani ayo mkala na kaburi lya kutsikila lya sambi, lyang'ana yatsikighwe munu amwo baye. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Kwaapfila likala Litsuwa lya Wayahudi lya ukwitanda kwa ajili ya Isabato, walwika amwo ilukuli lwa Yesu, mana likaburi alyo tsa lyahabehi.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kotsilihuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Malk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Nemitondotondo litsuwa lya mwanduso lya juma, kung'ali na ichisi, Mariya Magidalena kaghenda kuna likaburi, kona libwe liseghetsighwa kulawa hana ghumlango ghwa likaburi . <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Baho katsuma kaghenda kwa Simoni Petiri na imwanafunzi yungi, ayula iyakundighwe na Yesu, kawalongela, “Walusola ilukuli lwa Imtwatsa kuna likaburi, na ng'atumanyile baye kwawamwikile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Baho Petiri, na imwanafunzi yungi ayula, woka waghenda kuna likaburi. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Wose weli watsuma, lekeni ayula imwanafunzi yungi katsuma himahima kumbita Petiri, kandusa yeye kupfika kuna likaburi. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Kenama kasungulila mghati, kona isanda ya ichitani, lekeni ng'engile baye mghati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Kuya naye Simoni Petiri, iyakalile kuchughu kwake, kapfika na kengila mghati mwa likaburi; na kayona isanda ya ichitani pfaikalile, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />na ichitambala ichohighwe mwitwi mwa Yesu, ng'achikalile hamwe ne isandabaye, ila chipfingilisighwa na chikala hanu hake chiliyeka. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Baho imwanafunzi yungi ayula, iyanduse kupfika kuna likaburi, pfipfila kengila mghati, kona na katoghola. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Mbaka aho tsawang'ali ng'ana wamanye baye Ghamaandiko ighalongile kuwa Yesu kobamighwa yatsihiluke. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Kuya iwanafunzi awo woka ukaye yawo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlawila Mariya Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Malk 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Lekeni Mariya tsakema hanze habehi na likaburi kolila. Hayang'ali yolila, kenama kasungulila mghati mwa likaburi; <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />kawona malaika weli iwapfalile magwanda ighomeletsuka, wakala hasi ahala halukalile luwasitsighwa ilukuli lwa Yesu, yumwe ubali wa litwi, na yungi ubali wa ghamaghulu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Nawo wamghutsa, “Mamo, ulilila choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Mariya kawedika, “Wamsola Imtwatsa wangu, na simanyile baye kwawamwikile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Kuya Mariya kahunduka kuchughu, kamwona Yesu kema, lekeni ng'amanyile baye kama ayo tsa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu kamghutsa, “Mamo, angu chaulila choni? Umbama nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Mariya kafikitsa kolonga na iyololesa ibostani, apfo kamlongela, “Ghwemtwatsa, ana umsolile ghweghwe nongele umwikile kwani, nighende nikamsole.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu kamwidika, “Mariya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Mariya kahunduka, kalonga kwa Chieburaniya “Rabboni!” Mana yake “Mlangulitsi wangu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu kamlongela, “Leka kunikinda, kwaapfila sina nguluke baye kughenda kuchanya kwa Baba. Lekeni ghenda kwa ndughu tsangu ukawalongele, Nene noghuluka kughenda kuchanya kwa Aba wangu iyali Aba wenu, kwa Imlungu wangu iyali Imlungu wenu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Afo Mariya Magidalena kaghenda kawalongela iwanafunzi kama kamwona Imtwatsa, kawalongela na achila chayamlongele.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila iwanafunzi wake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Malk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Haipfikie hamihe, mna litsuwa alila lya kwanza lya juma, iwanafunzi wetingana hamwe akuno imilango ihindighwa kwa ukuwapfuka iwakulu wa Wayahudi. Baho Yesu katsa, kema haghatighati hawo, kawalongela, “Mkale tseghamba.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Hayamalitse ukulonga apfo, Yesu kawalangusa ghamoko ghake na ilubapfu lwake. Iwanafunzi wadeng'elela ng'ani hawamwonile Imtwatsa. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu kawalongela keli, “Mkale tseghamba. Kama Baba pfayanitumile nene, na nene nomtumani mwemwe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Kuya kawapfilila, kawalongela, “Bokeleni Iloho Yelile. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Wo wose wamwaleghusila tsinzambi, iwanu awo woleghusighwa; na wo wose yamleka kuwaleghusila tsinzambi, awo ng'awoleghusighwa baye.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlawila Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Lekeni yumwe mna iwanafunzi wake kumi na weli, Tomasi, iyakemighwe Didimasi, mana yake Basa, ng'akalile baho baye hayatsile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Apfo wanafunzi wayaghe wamlongela, “Tumwona Imtwatsa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Lekeni Tomasi kawalongela, “Nene bila kutsona tsing'opfu tsa imisumari mna ghamoko ghake, na kwika ichidole changu mna tsing'opfu atso, na kwika ghumoko ghwangu mlubapfu lwake, hata chidogho ghendo sitoghola baye.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Haghabitile matsuwa manane, iwanafunzi wake wetingana hamwe keli mng'anda, naye Tomasi tsakakala baho.Yesu katsa, akuno imilango ihindighwa, kema haghatighati hawo, kawalongela, “Mkale tseghamba.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Kuya kamlongela Tomasi, “Utse wike ichidole chako ahano, ughalole ghamoko ghangu, kuya ugholose ghumoko ghwako ughwingitse mlubapfu lwangu; uleka kuwa munu iyolema kutoghola, ila utoghole!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi kamwidika, kalonga, “Mtwatsa wangu na Mlungu wangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu kamghutsa, “Kwotoghola kwaapfila kumbona? Wabweda awala ing'awonile lekeni wotoghola!”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hebari chandikighwe ichitabu achino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu tsakatenda pfihulo pfingi hambele ha iwanafunzi wake, ing'apfandikighwe baye mna ichitabu achino. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Lekeni apfino pfandikighwa ili mdahe kutoghola Yesu yuyo Kiristu, Imwana wa Imlungu, na kwa ukutoghola akwo muwe na ugima mghati mwa litaghwa lyake.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila wanafunzi saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Hambele Yesu kawalawila keli wanafunzi wake mmbalimbali mwa litsimbu lya Tiberiya. Tsakawalawila apfino, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petiri, Tomasi iyakemighwe Basa, Nasanaeli iyalawile Kana, ghumji ghwa Galilaya, iwana wa Sebedayo, na iwanafunzi wake wangi weli, wose tsawakala hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petiri kawalongela, “Noghenda kulowa somba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Wamlongela, “Na twetwe twoghenda naghwe.” Apfo woka, wengila mna ghumnumbwi; lekeni ichilo achila chose ng'awapatile chinu baye.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Nemitondotondo hakuchele, Yesu katsa kema mmbalimbali mwa litsimbu; lekeni iwanafunzi ng'awamtangile baye kama tsa Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Baho Yesu kawaghutsa, “Wanangu, mna somba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Wamwidika, “Baye.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Kuya kawalongela, “Yaseni ichelo lubali lwa kujilo lwa ghumnumbwi, mtsoghogha somba.” Baho wachasa ichelo mmatsi; na wapata somba wengi ng'ani mbaka wang'ali wokukuluka nacho ukuchikwegha ichelo.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Baho imwanafunzi ayula iyakundighwe na Yesu kamlongela Petiri, “Ayuno Imtwatsa.” Bahala Simoni Petiri hayahulike ayula tsakakala Imtwatsa, keyoha ligwanda lyake, kwaapfila tsakalitsula, kuya keyasa mna ghamatsi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Iwanafunzi wangi watsa kuna ghyumnumbwi, kwaapfila tsang'awakalile hatali na isi baye, ila tsawakala utali wa futi miya ndatu apfino, wawapfila ukuchikwegha ichelo ichimemile wasomba. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Hawapfikile kumbalimbali kwa litsimbu, wona makala ighakwaka moto na somba wekighwa mchanya mwake, hamwe na chighate.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu kawalongela, “Seghetseni ahano somba chidogho wamghoghile sambi.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Kuya Simoni Petiri kadina mna ghumnumbwi, kakwegha ichelo mbaka mmbalimbali mwa litsimbu, chimema somba wakulu miya imwe na hamsini na ndatu. Lekeni hamwe na wasomba awo kuwa wengi apfo, ichelo ng'achidegheke baye. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu kawalongela, “Itseni mje.” Wala kuduhu hata mnu yumwe mna iwanafunzi awala iyaghetsile kumghutsa, “Ghweghwe uli nani?” Kwaapfila tsawamanya yuyo Imtwatsa. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu katsa, kasola ichighate kaweng'a, pfipfila kasola na wasomba awala, kaweng'a.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Aino ikala mala ya kadatu Yesu kuwalawila wanafunzi wake kulawa hayatsihiluke mlifwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga na Petiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Hawamalitse ukuja, Yesu kamlongela Simoni Petiri, “Simoni mwana wa Yohane, apfi ghweghwe kwonikunda kubita awano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Naye kamwidika, “Ona, Ghwemtwatsa, ghweghwe kwomanya kama nene na sale yako ghendo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu kamlongela, “Wadime iwanang'olo wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Kuya Yesu kamghutsa mala ya kabili, “Simoni mwana wa Yohane, apfi ghweghwe kwonikunda nene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Naye kamwidika, “Ona, Ghwemtwatsa, ghweghwe kwomanya ka nene nasale yako ghendo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu kamlongela, “Wadime wang'olo wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Kamghutsa keli mala ya kadatu, “Simoni mwana wa Yohane, apfi ghweghwe kwasale yangu ghendo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Simoni Petiri kahutsunika kwaapfila kamghutsa mala ya kadatu, “Apfi ghweghwe kwa sale yangu ghendo?” Kamwidika, “Ghwemtwatsa, ghweghwe kwomanya pfinu pfose; ghweghwe kwomanya kama nene na sale yako ghendo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu kamlongela, “Wenge ghumghina wang'olo wangu. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Nokulongela kweli ghendo, haukalile msongolo, ung'ali wiyoha msipi ghumwenyegho na kughenda hanu haubamile; lekeni hautsolala kutsogholosa ghamoko ghako, munu yungi katsokwoha na msipi na kukughala hanu ghumwenyegho ng'auhabama.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Kalonga apfo kulangusa Petiri pfayatsakufa na kumtunitsa Imlungu. Hayamalitse ukulonga apfo, kamlaghitsa, “Niwinze!”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na imwanafunzi iyamkundile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petiri kahunduka, kamwona imwanafunzi ayula iyakundighwe na Yesu kowawinza. Imwanafunzi ayuno ambe tsaayula iyeghame mmambagha mwa Yesu mna ichijo cha Ipasaka, na iyamghutsile, “Ghwemtwatsa, yuhi iyatsokubiduka?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Petiri hayamwonile ayo, kamghutsa Yesu, “Ghwemtwatsa, ayuno naye pfihi?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu kamwidika, “Ana nibama ayo yakale mgima mbaka hanikutsa, agho ughabamila choni ghweghwe? Ghweghwe niwinze nene!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Apfo imbuli aino yenela kuna wandughu kuwa imwanafunzi ayula tsang'atsakufa baye. Lekeni Yesu ng'alongile kuwa imwanafunzi ayula ng'atsakufa baye, ila, “Ana nibama ayo yakale mgima mbaka hanikutsa, agho ughabamila choni ghweghwe?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ayuno yuyo imwanafunzi iyoghalonga aghano, na iyaghandike; natwe twomanya kuwa agho ghayalongile kalongesa ghendo.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumalitsila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Kuna pfinu pfingi ng'ani pfayatendile Yesu; na apfo pfose pfing'andikighwa chimwechimwe, nakona isi yose ng'aibamile iwe na hanu baye ha ukwika ipfitabu ipfibamighwe pfandikighwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>